<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Iyyoobikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iyyoobikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iyyoobikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iyo.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iyyoobikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyoobiki Maxaaf giddo afendaaxi jirte jabaxxi rakkona ba'ne gelteeke mitte arji manjixxa jirte leellishshaaxxeni. Kunni manji oosetanna karra duuchcha gopha calla kaddebaangi lumoxxe madani ganeme abara uuda'neeni; Okkoo'ni xingotixxe bifanni shiqeeke sase haaso'ini Iyyoobinna Iyyoobiki jaaluwwi konne geyyeeke abara'ni insa'ne'ni laqendee qico haassona'neeni; udumii'ninna Mageni Iyyoobi'a leellaani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyoobiki jaaluwwinna Iyyoobi'ni gelteexxe rakko'a shiqinsha'neeki yaadi insa'ne baranteexe aadanni yookaani addenniteni; tennexxee insa'ne «Mageni eloke manji'a eloxxa yaane assaa wodda, fuggichcha manjo kinni xixaani; konne qicinni Iyyoobi'ni tinni rakko duuchcha gelteeki Iyyoobi hujeexe cubbo'aateni» hinaammani; yaane kinni Iyyoobi hara eloke manjo kadeemmaxxe tinni iitta hexxeexi jabaxi xixa geltaake manjommabaani; matanga hiibbote kaddeexxi yaane iso fakkaataake eloke manjo'ni iitta geltaaxi rakko geyateni; haranna Iyyoobi addeti daaqanna gophoole, Mageni toggitte murte isixxa uwwati rakkotenaa'ni fulchche birexe eloxe hedhobaa hiissaashsha kadhate'ni goofebaani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mageni Iyyoobike qortumuwwi duuchchi'a mitte mittengee hiissichcho uwwa gophoolenna, adde isixxika jabeenna mambe'a hiyyati magenuntetixxa hunna isixxanna beekkuma mambe'a hinaaxe gencenni kula'neeni; okkonechchinni udumi'a Iyyoobi Mageni lumokena beekake kadeexa kokati isi edo mufetina hunnati haaso'eexa faaci'ati aade aageeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muuxatibaanna gencete kaddebaaxe borreessanni Iyyoobi birexxe eloxxe hedhoba higeexa kuldaaxxenna matanga karratenaa'ni birexxenaa'ni saxxexa karra alfeexa kuldaani; Iyyoobiki jaaluwwi Iyyoobi'ni gelteexxi rakko mayeete kaddeexa aaggebaangi haasonneexxee Mageni jaba qicinni insa'ne xixe'eni; baratendeexe aadanni haaso'ati irra Mageni lumoke Mageno kadeexxa aaggeeki Iyyoobi'aan callammani.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoobi karra, mini hadonna fayyunte gopheexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:10-2:13">1:10—2:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoobi ilemeexxa barra yowwe <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-26">3:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Taakkaxxa mari'e <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Langaxxa mari'e <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1—21:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sakkaxxa mari'e <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 22:1-26:14">22:1—26:14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxatika haaso'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 27:1-30:31">27:1—30:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoobi balleessa afebaaxxa koke haaso'e <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 31:1-40">31:1-40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Eelihute hinaake manjika haaso'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Siretika Mageniinka haaso'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-39:30">38:1—39:30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Langaka Mageniinka haaso'anna Iyyoobika hiissichcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 40:1-42:6">40:1—42:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni illeema Iyyoobi fayyunteti, karratinna mini hadinni eebbise <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42:7-17</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Duriisi Iyyoobii'i Hega Uude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Utsi hiyyemaake boga'ni Iyyoobi hiyyemaak mitti manjichchi hedhemman; isinna fuggoxxe duuchchanaa'ni bayyate'e Mageno sodataammake, elokenna addatemeemmake manjjomman. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Isixxi oossenna torbaane labbaxxenna sase dubarramman. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Afeemmak hori: torbaane kuma Gedhebo, sase kuma gaala, mitte kuma qotiyyo onde dhibba harremmani. Ittani yo'ooshsha heddo isi'a huja'ni ergataaka manna afeemman. Boroti darre'ni hedhemmake bogguwwike manna duuchanaa'ni durummatinna isoo lekka uggaaki hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Iyyoobixxi labbaxxi oose aanchi aanchik ifi fike mine'ni mitteba bukki hite'e itta'ni ha'wita'n gammaddaamman; ifixxa sasiinxa dayyuwwa ye'e'na'ni mitteba inde'e ha'wina'emman. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Mitteba ite ha'watixxi barruwwa muuxendee uduma langa baro gorsan ke'eexxi Iyyoobi oose ye'iseexxi mitte mittende ifixxe oosexxee tolcha tolchaa'emman; tennee assaammalchchii, akimagaada anxi oose keekkattebaang godobi giddo Mageno yowwite cubbo hujjeen hiyye'e hedeemmaxxe'e oosettixxa cubbo biro'atemman.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Barratixxa barra iimmixxi ergganna Mageni edo shiqqe wodda durriisikinna welt shiqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:2">Dada. 6:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna «Habaa'ni daggette?» hiyye durriisa qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Durriisikinna, «Buttate'ni elqe kayya mammaremaannan» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Magenikinna Durriisa «Erganjo anka Iyyoobii'i meya hubbattenni uuddee'ette? Isishsha hedheek elokinna addatemeeki manjji buttate'ni hedhebaan; isi fuggoxxe duuchchanaa'n bayyate'e anee sodata'neeke dhugaatike manjon» hiyye. <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Durriisikinna hiisseexxi «Iyyoobi atee sodata'neechch iittande? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Isiqqa atee sodata'neechch isoonna oose isixxa, afexa karra duuchcha heqqite'e nageessiteettaxxeeten; assedhexxe duchchan isoo eebbisse'e heddo hore utettexeeteba? <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Yaane kinni afeechcho duuchcha birtettele uddaa'naanni atee yowwaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Wal. 12:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Mageni Durriisa «Eloxxen, yoona Iyoobi calla kissoxxe malee afeechcho duuchcha eetettexxa assedha dandeettatton» hiyye. Ookkonechchinni udumi'a Durriisi Mageni edii'ni fule me'e.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobixxe Oosexxa Reyonna Karra Isixxe Duuchchixxa Muda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Mitte barraxxa barra Iyyoobixxi oose insa'neeke angafi mine'eni jilate'ni bukki hinee indda'ni woyinetika bulbulo ha'wina'neenge'ni <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />Iyyoobiba ergemeeki mitti manjichchi gonga'ni dageexxi «No'o duuchchiing qotilet hunja'eennan; harruwwatinna no'on bira dheedda'emman; <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />dedhange'ni Saabake bogiki manni dage loleexxi duuchchiin gechcho adhdhe me'e; atika erganjuwwanna wolaantichchiki shiye biree'na'a ani calli lubo gatee ate'ni kulonnaa dagennen.»<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Ediseemmaki erganji haaso'a afoo'i'ni birebaang welengi erganji dageexxi, «Banqo ibbe gedhebokanna allalisano birtte, ani calli lubbo gatee ate'ni kulonna'a dagenne» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Iikki erganji haaso'a afoo'ni birebaang weleeng erganji dagee'xxi, «Sasi qorbi Kaladaanik manni dedhangge'ni dage'e no'oo loleexxi gaaluwwakanna adhdhe'e erganjuwwakanna shiye biree'naa, ani calli lubbo gate'e ate'ni kulonna'a dagenne» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Kunni erganji haaso'a afoo'ini birebaang welngi erganji dageexxi, «Oose attixxi duuchchinxi jilatee'e angafiinke mine'ni bukki hite'e itta'ne'e woyinetixxa booka ha'witaa'emmani; <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />gammoojje qiilli darre'ni kexxeexxi hobonbalte dedhaanga dagge'e mine dhiibbeeni, minikinna hedheeshshanni insa'ne'ni ibe shiyee'naa'a ani calli lubbo gate'e ate'ni kulonna'a dageennen» hiyye. <verse eid="JOB 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Ookkonechchinni udumi'a Iyyoobi iimi'a qophphi hiyye ke'eexxi yaadeemmaxxee seemma ifixxa dare umokanna haaxxe; buttanna kumbuyye sagada'n <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />«Ama anixxike godobanaa'ni ileme'e buttina uudenne baro mittilchchi afeennalchchi hedhemmabaan; reyanno barronna mittelchchonna adhdhe me'abo'non; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti uwween; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti adhdhe; Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galat geyowwaal!»<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Iyyoobi, tinni hega uushsho duuchcha geltoolenna hara cubbo hujebaan; Magenoke'n fuggoxxa fulchedheba'a.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Durriisi Iyyoobii'i Higgenna hega uude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Barratixxa barra Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi Mageniinxi erganna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo bukki hite shiqqee wodda durriisikinna insa'nenni mittemba afeme.<verse eid="JOB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna «Habaa'ni daggette? Hiyyeexxi durriisa qore; durriisikinna buttate'ni elqenna kayya maremaannani» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna durriisa «Erganjo anika Iyyoobii'i meya hubatte uuddeette? Isishsha hedheeki dhugaatiki eloki manji buttate'ni hedhebaani; isi elobaaxxe duuchchanaa'ni bayyate'e ane'e sodata'neeke addateme'eke manjon. Isoo balleessitottaa eetii'i ati'a uwonna'a anee tirtiirsiteettek dharkiten; ta'atenna kaddoole Iyyoobi woldishshanni addatenshat'eni jabaate'e hedheen» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Durriisikinna hisseexxi, «Bisiinke gogiinxa bakka bisiinka goga» hiyyendeemmashsha «Manjiqqa lubbo ifixxa gatliso'a afeechcho duuchcha uwwaan. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Yaane kinni biso isika duuchcha gande'naa miidhemeele uuddaa'naanni Ate'e yowwaan.»<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Mageni Durriissa, «Eloxxeni, iso shiltoxxe malee eetettexxa assi» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Okkonechchinni udumi'a durriisi Mageniinbaa'ni ke'e me'eexxi Iyyoobi umokenaa'ni lekkati qico'ni bisi duuchchi mado'ashsha asse. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Okkonechchi udumi'a Iyyoobi bululo hunnammaxxe kose iima ofo'le mada balchiki hoqoolqate'ni ke'e.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Are isixxinna «Ta'anna ati Magenonge addatta'eet? Tenne mannii'ni Mageno yowwite reyi!» hite.<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Iyyoobinna «Hitta Magno egendebaaxxe melaalleka haaso'a haasottette? Mageni eloxxa yaane no'a uwwa wodda gammadiki adhdhinnanno; rakko no'o'a uwwa woddata iso'ni gungummanno?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Iyyoobi tinni duuchcha rakkonna abara iso'ni geltoolenna fuggoka afo'o Magenoke'ni fulchedhe cubbo hujebaani.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobi uudo'a Sase Isike Jaaluwwixxa Daga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Teemaani hinaake bogiki manji Elifaazi, Shuha hiyyemaake bogiki manji Bilidaadinna Naa'ima hiyyemaake bogiki manji Soofaari; kunni sasiing manni Iyyoobike jaaluwwammani; insa'nenna Iyyoobi'ni gelteexxa rakkonna abara lanqeexxi lanqo'anna jajjabeesino'a ifi ifike boganaa'ni fulle'e mitteba Iyyoobibaa dange. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Hanqonni he'ne'e Iyyoobi anfe, kaddo malee kinni Iyyoobite kadeexxa ege'nineemmaba'a; isumma egenneexxinna yaandeemmaxxee ifi fixxa seemma daddarra'n, buko ifi ifike umo'n fifilxina'n oo'ne hunbaashshine. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Hittee qico rakkateexxa uundeemmaxxee mittelchchonna iso'ni haasonnebaang torbaane barranna hashsha isi bira buttinake'ni ofolle turre.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobi Ilemeexxa Barra Bade</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Okkonechchinni udumi'a Iyyoobi haso'ake'ni ke'exxi ilemeexxa barra badina'n<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Hiyyee qici<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />«Ama anixxi anee horatteexxa hashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:3">Ilemennexxe barra'anna ise'a hoola!<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Iitti ilemennexxi barra dukande hexxowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">iimiki Mageni isee qaabbatoqqe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">haranga ifi ise'a ifoqqe;<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Himminni xaxee'naa'a dimma dukkana ise'e buqqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">duumanchi buqe'e abide'naa'a ifi ise'a leelloqqe'e;<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Iitti hashsha dimma dukkanaxxe kaddowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">agenjoke'ninna woggatike laakkossa barruwwati giddo e'yite lako'endoqqe'e.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Iitti hashsha maseentote kaddowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">gammadi yookaan illillisa ise'ni hexxoqqe'e;<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Lumoxxa jawwe hinaaka abbaayya giddika lumoka biniinchuwwa hoola hiyye lele'misaammaki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">ettene barra'a hoola hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Eettene hashsha'a bakkalchuwwi ifa gophummadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">iitti hashsha sooda gophpho'a yanna qeerrexxuummadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">soodee'na ifi ifaan hinaaki hedumi gatuummadu;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Erm. 20:14-18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />Rakko uudabo'noshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">anixxe amake godobanaa'ni ilemabo'noshsha assa gopheemmaxxe ettene barra'a hoola!<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Anixxe amake godobi giddo wode'e kade'e gatuunnadu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">Ilemenege'e hirba'ni maye'e Mageni ane'e shiya gophe?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Maye'e anxi ama gudeeda iseke'ni ane'e luu'mexxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">maye'e isi ununa iseka ane'e ununsite?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Silanni okkone wodda reyeennele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">ta'a konne wodda hafuura adhdheennan<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />Ta'a diigeme'e hedheeka motummatika minuwwa ifi'a ijaadhdheemmake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">buttatike moyanjuwwanna insa'neeke ja'laabuwwinni silanni diiphe'e hafuura adhdheennan;<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Mine ifike'ni biretika sibiljonna worqe wonshedheeke hayyichchuwwinni welti silanni diipheennani;<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Yookaani ifa uudebaang mongeemmake lubbo afebaak ilemeechcho kaduunnadu;<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Moogemeeki fuggaaleessi manni fuggo huja isixxi ookko gabalendeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">elo'e daffe'e itaammakinna ookko hafuura adhdhe.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Booji'emeemmaki manninna midde ookko nage'iki hedhaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">insa'ne'e ajajaammake mannixxe mootumma'ni gateeni.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Lummedheekinna jala hedheeki mitteba ookko hedhaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">garbooletixxi garbbumma gala ookko gattaan.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Rakkotinna abarki hedha'neeke manni'a ifi maye'a ife?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">Yada'ni cummummi hiyya'ni hedha'neekee'e mayete uurre me'ashsha kaddeeki?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Ba'eeka maallaqa fiiddi hiyye'e hasaammake mannishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">reyo'a reyo halsa'neeki manni maye'a uurre me'ashsha kadde?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">Wal. 9:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Reye moogemeele gamada'neki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">maye'e uurre'e me'ashsha kadde?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Me'a'neeki ori itti duudeekenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">Mageni itti cufe'e xillikki asseeki manji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">mayete hedhot uurre'e me'ashsha kaddeeki?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Oodhishsha ani'a itate kaddeeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">indiddo wodi'insha dunenneni.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Sodaatennexxi yaane ane'e hanqattebaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">ane'e godobi kuleexxi anenaa'ni gattebaani.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Rakkonna abara malee'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">nage'a afe'e hafuura adhdhebo'noni» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elfaazika Siretika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Teemaanike bogiki maniji Elifaazi Iyyoobikee haaso'i'a hisse haaso'ani:<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Ta'a ani atinni haaso'enele ossiteenni caqqassatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Kaddomalee kinni haaso'a walabo'noni?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Ati heddo manna barsiissa'eettani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">gargaaraaka afebaaka manna jajabeessita'ettani.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Hedhdo gugguffateekara gorisitaatanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">shaqqeekaranna jabeessitaatani.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Ta'a kinni rakko ate'ninni daggeemmaxxee atinni hophpholdeetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">rakko a'uritemmaxxeenna mekki hitee'tteni.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Mageno sodaatta'n mitte ci'ma belo hexxetten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">tennexxee Magenoke'ni kiphate jabaat.<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />«Cubbo hujebake manjo kade'e rakko geltee'na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">ba'edheeki manji hedheexxe kaddoole hedi me'eke?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Ani uudenneshshate kadoole midha hunjjammashsha fuggoxxa huccaaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">midhatishsha rakkote haa'maani.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Mageni insa'nee ifike Hafuurinni balleessaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">Ifixxe mufetixxe diidallonninna biraan,<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Fuggaaleeyye Neenqiinshsha harqitaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">Mageni kinni, isso insa'neexxa enqe eniqe biraani.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Neenqi abide itaachcho gophoole reyammashsha insa'nenna rennaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">Neenqi okkonexxi beltanna xeerendammashshanni insa'neexxi oosenna xereendaani.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />«Mitte barra erga mitte sho'iki aniba gelte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">tenne erganna mitti manji manshshate'n hashasha'ni kule.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Manji hashsha diiphe cokokki hiyye'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">alaalshshitaaxxa oojjo hashsha oojjotee wodda,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:15">Iyo. 33:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Alayye sodaatenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">bisi duuchchinni roqoonse culphisenne.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Gandammaxxe diidalloshsha alba anka fiya'ni sa'eechchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">alayokenaa'n kexxeexxa bisi ank orda ke'isse.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Ookko uurree'naa mittelchcho afenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">yaane kinni hubate uuddannoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">maachcho kaddeexxa haakenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ookkoneechchi uduma mittilchchinna shokki hiyya'neechchi hedhebaaxxe bakka'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">laqqenneki hasoo'i hiyyaamma qici<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‹Mageni edo manji ca'ichchake?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Manji dadeemmake Mageni irra qullichchakee?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Mageni Ifika erganjjuwwa addata gopha'noole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">Ifixxe erigana'ninna midde dedhdha afa'neeke kadoole,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />Hittata buttinakenaa'ni dademeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ookkone butinana'ni woyo'ebaakanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">corroqqa shiixxonigechchi'a rertammashsha reyaaka manjjo addata?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Manji gorsa lubbondinni hedheekee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">dedhange'ni galgala reye ba'aani.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Horateechcho duuchchanaa'n fuleexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">Mageniinka ora ege'nebaang reyaani.›<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />«Koo, Iyyoobi! Ati'a hiisichcho uwwa'neeki manji dedha hedhoole amo ye'edhi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Atee gargaartaaxxi erganna heente?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Gowwa manjo hifote shiltaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">hinaaffe anna okkonende balleessita<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Gowwakee yaane duchcha eldee'na uudenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">yaane kinni Mageni ikkiwoddi mine isika diige<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Oose isixxi irkattaachcho afooqe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">murtetixxe songo'ni insa'ne'a baassaki hedha gophemmaxxe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">seeri beloxxi insa'ne'ni geltowwaal<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Huceexxa midha soolo'weeki manni itoowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">wele walini utetixxe oddo'ni ibbeexxa midde isi'a gatisabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">dhebo'weeki manninna karra isixxa adhdho'a yoraani<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Rakko itaanni butti'ni daggeechchobani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">abarikinna bada'atishsha buttini giddii'ni imi'a lateechchobaani<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Qaanqe boosi'n iimi'a xoggitammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">ittanni manjikinna rakkoteenna abarake ilemaan.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />«Ateenna ante kadennele Maggeniibaa wirri hiyyannan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">rakko anixxanna iso'inni ku'la'naa<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Isi konnete hinabaaka manibe'uwwanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">egennabaaxxa lumolluwwa yaanuwwa assaani<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Buttate'ni xeena gansiisa'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">fichchuwwakanna shanshe goddisani<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Saliiphatemakara lummise ulfeesaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">yaadaammmakaranna gammachchiisaan<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Hendeexxa muunxabaashsha xaqartiyyetika heduma tola gatisaan<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Beekkoletee xaqaro insa'neexxi insa'ne'a fonxorote kaddaashsha assan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">xaqartiyyetika heduma oraani gatisa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:19">1 Qor. 3:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Barra insa'ne'ni dukkandaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">bara saafo'a dukkana giddo me'eke manjishsha titimminsaani<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Hiyyeeyye naphiinke bagedonaa'ni gatisaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">rakkiyye miicaammake mannixxe anganaa'ni fulchaani<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Hiyyeeyyetee assanno hiyyeexxa assaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">fuggaaleeyyetanna buttatteenaa'ni balleessaani.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />«Manji eloke ora'ni me'ashsha Mageni xixaake manjixxa wodo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">Tennexxee lumoke Magenika xixiichcho tufatoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">Mam. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:5-6">Ibr. 12:5-6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Mageni atee enqoolenna hisse xaasaakeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">mitte angani atee miidhoole mitteti fayyisaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos. 6:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Jaane ate'e miitaxxe yaanenaa'n anjiraan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">torbeessoxxe'inna miidhendaboxxon.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Solo'iinka baro rertaboxxoshsha atee heqqaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">bagedin sanenna reyotenaa'n atee gatisaan<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Mageni atee fuggoke arrabikenaa'n heqqaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">arda mitaaxxi yaane daggoolenna sodaattaboxxoni<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Atee miidho'a ke'aaka mannanna kadi solo'o tuffattattoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">manna miidhaaka biniinchanna sodaattabexxoni<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Huccitatto wodda kino ati edii'n baqattaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">biniichchikinna atee kisabaani nage'ki hexxattoni<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Atike duunkaana'ni nagei'ki hexxattoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">gedhebo goodhe giddo towattatto wodda nege'ing hedhee'naa affattoni<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Ila atixxi birasaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">buttatixxe badda'asshha fakkandaan<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Midha haammammaxxe yanna qico'ni fichchi giddo turtammashshanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">atinna wogga godditee cindatto qico'ni hexxatton<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Koo Iyyoobi, no'o tinni duuchcha dhuugaate kaddeexxa hubante'e uunideenneni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">amo tennee laqqee isee hujete'n hosis.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Iyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ookkoneechchin uduma Iyyoobi hiyyee qici: <verse eid="JOB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />«Ani rakkatenne qicinna yadeenne qico minkeele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">unda'nechcho kadee'naa uunida'neele<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Silan abbaayyatike maanichchi irra a'uuran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">tennexxeeten jaammi hiye'e haaso'enneki.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni Ifike mogiduwwinni anee oteen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ha'la konne mogiduuwwixxinna anike bisi giddo duuchcha facaateeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">bajabaja assaaki Magniinki ochchi ane'ni timeen.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Isi harre ittaaxxi badda'a heexxe'naa ha'issaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">Yookaani qotiyyichchi okee'i hedhee'naanni itaachi'a barooda?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Bushaxxa ita maxine ugginebaaki inda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">Yookaani quuphphi giddiki wodi'i xe'ma?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Iitta hexxeexxa ita cori ane'e gibisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">itonnoolenna ela gophisa.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />«Soodachcho anixxa laqee Mageni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">halchennelchcho ani'a uwweele,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Mageni anee balleesseele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">hedho anixxa kute'e qurubbi asseele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">eeyyannani!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Konne woyyichchika hiyyichcho giba gophaannaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">feetee qiconna rakko ane'e'ni bira saxxeelenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">gammada'n uutaalannani.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />«Maa uduuda afenneke hedhoti hedhanno hiya'enne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Maa hedhaanneki bari gatee'na osaa'enne?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Ani kinjoke odo'weenne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Yookini bisi sageettoti sbiljke?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Ani ifi kiphanno hiyaannoxxi hunna hexxebaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">afeennaxxi hunna ani giddii'ni xo'o hiteeni.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />«Sinsino'e jaalo ifika gibaaki manjji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">Mageno sodaata waaleke manjoni.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Anki jaaluwwi kinni burqe bagamma burqike wodi'ishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">adaachchisaakebaan<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Haarsixxa yanna konne wode'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">kaadee baqaqe'naa hu'nusso'aan,<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Boni daga wodda kinni baqe baxxaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">lagi bage'e (duwwitti) gataan.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Gaaluuwwa fe'edhe ora me'ammaki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">orri'ni gore'e wodee hasito gammoojje qiilla giddo doonsakiyya hiya'nee reyaani.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Ora me'ammaki Teema hinaake bogiki manni wodee hasito dagaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">Saabake bogixxi dadaaltuwwanna wodi'i hedheeshsha adattani.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Addanteemmaki wodi'i baggee'na'a anfaa wodda mekki hina'ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">eettene bakkaba'anna gennaa wodda aarre bojogemmaan.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Ha'no ani'a ookkone bage gatemmake wodi'ishshaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">anee'ni gelteexxa rakkonna abara uuddinee alaltineen.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Egedhdhi isi ani konnechcho ani'a uwwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">yookaani karra ha'nooxxeni anee lubbo hirre hiyyeenna?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Yookaani naphiinxe anganaa'ni anee wodde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">yookaani miicammake mannixxe anee gatisee hiyyeene?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />«Deedhi hujenneki heedhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">Ane'ni kulle ani sammi hiyyannoni.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Dhugaatiki hiyyichchi auroolenna aannete afeen!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Ha'nooki haaso'i kinni mittilchi'aanna woyi fuleekebaan<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Haaso'a anika afo'oke'n xixxinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">Anee konnee hoophpholeenneke manjichchika haaso'a diidallotishsha uddineen.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Annanna ama afebaake belto'ni ha'no weli'an weli hixa ibirsitinaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">ifi'a duroondino'a jaaluwwa ha'nooka gurgudhdhitnoo'a gadhaffissinaan.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />«Ballo'o alba anika uudde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">ha'no edo dhara haaso'anno?<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Balesitine'eni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">ta'ana waale; ane'ni mitti dedhi hedhebaxxa ege'ne<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Anke afo'ona'ini fugoxxi fulide'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">ani dharanna dhuuga garigari ase'e egenebo'no hiyyote?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />«Manjiinki galdumi buttate'ni hunnati hujinsammake manjichike galdumabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Hedho isixxi manjokee fiiddi hiyye hujaammake mannixxe hedhooshshateba'a?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Mannake hujammaki manni arishsho giddo huje'e gaaddisake'n ofo'lo'a halchammashshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">hujemmaka runda uuno'a heqqedhammake maniishshatebaa?<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Agenji sa'e agenji dagaashshanni ani'a mittende horoomebo'no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">Hashsha saxxe'e hashsha daggaashshanni waye uudaanne.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Diiphonna'a sa'onnole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">‹soodanni sooda› hiyya'nee yaadano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">yane kinni mittendi hashsha ane'ni lamete kaddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">suuki hiyyebo'nong gangalata'ni galanno<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Bisi aniki duuchchi corroqo'eni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ca'li hiyye'e malo'a'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">qonnonnotinna ane'ni wo'miteeni.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />«Bari anik harf giddo mooqqo gongtamma irra gonga'neen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ani'a elani hiyye heqqedhaannelchchi hedhebaang muda'neen<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Ee, Mageno! Hedho anixxi uffu hinammake hafuri jalixxe kaddeexxa kassi hiyyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">ta'anni elqi'a mitte eloxxa yaane uudabe'noon<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Ta'a uudaanneki manji langaxxa ane'e uudabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">hasenna midde anee afabaani.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Duumaanchi sa'eexxi ba'emmashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">reye mogemeeki manni langaxxa hige dagabaani<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Isi ifike minibaa langaxxa higabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">iso ege'neemmaki duuchchinna dedhaani.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />«Tennexxee yoona haranga sammi hiyyabe'non.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">Uudenneke abaranaa'n kexxeexxa haso'anneni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">hedho ane'ni qaraarteemmaxxe'e gungumaanneni.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Konne qico elqe kayya higabo'noshsha anee heqqita'etteki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">ani is abbaayyate yookaan abbaayya giddike lumoke bofa?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Ma'na sa'e irkatee'na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">diiphi anee adhdheelee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">dhibe anenaa'n sholowwi hitammani hiyye hedenne<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />Ati kinni oojjoti anee bararassita'etten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">currusissa'ninna anee alalshita'etten.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Ani micco duwwike kada'ni hedhaannexxi hedho manii'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">suruura uggudhdhenexxi reyennexxa woyyan.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Ifi jibbeenne, hedhotinna anee gibiseen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">lubboti qeerraka baro tura gophaannexxee anee waali.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />«Hitta manjo isoo Ati lummisse'e uuda'ette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">Assaaxxe yanne'n mayee isoo gaadda'ette?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4">Far. 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:3">14:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Hashshe sodaashshanni yanna yanna'inni isoo hega uddaattelchchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">is manji machcho?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Hancufa gurucci assannoxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">shiixxoxxe yanna'a inqo ane waaldabexxo?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Ati manjo qorqortatto gootta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ani cubbo hujennexxee ati mayiki miidhendette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Mayeete ille atixxi ane'n uurriteeki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">aurteexxe ba'oshsha harange ate'ni a'urenne?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Haranga anixxa cubbo hatto hitaboxxo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Hujennexxa baleessa gattowwaal hitaboxxo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Reye'e bale giddo aagannoxxi yanna shiqqe'eni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ta'anni elqi'a anee hassettelenna hedhebe'noni.»<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Beelidaadii'i</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Shuha hinaake bogiki mani Bilidaadi Iyyobii hiyyee qici:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />«Ati haani qico'n ca'li hite'e iitta haasottette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Afo'o atikenaa'n fulaa'neeki haaso'i hobonbalteteni.<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Mageni dhugaa haranga gorsabaani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Gotti dhuggati muurani?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Oose atixxi Magenokee ajajema gibbe'e cubbo hujoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">cubbo insa'neexxxe Mageni insa'neenni xixenni hiyyoten.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Yanne kinn Mageniinbaa hige'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">duuchchinixxa dande'aaka Gootta soodaattottole,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />Dhugaa calla hujjottolenna qullichchake kaddoottole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">Isi hirbange'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">birebaa atee hiissaan.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Edi'a galdattoki galdumi siretikenaa'ni quba sa'eeke kadaan.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />«Amo mee, edo saxxeexxa ila qaabbati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">edike no'oke annuwwika galduma hubati uudi<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />No'o qeerraka baro tura gonpheennaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">mitti egennennelchchi hedhebaani, bari no'okinna gaaddisisiinsha sa'aken.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Insa'ne atee barsiissaaxxinna kullaaxxi ifi'a egenneexxi giddii'nitebaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Dhugaandinni Qoocce cafa'a hexxebaaba lattaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Yookaani leeddi wodi'i hedhebaaba lateexxi qufaataa?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Wodi'i bageexxe kaddoole kunnichchi nophphebaang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">wele badda'a edise bagani.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Ittanni Mageno dedhaakinna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">Mageni belo hedhaaki manni udumi uduma'a ba'aani,<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Magenjooletike haadishsha xa'a hite kutendaaxxe yaanuwwa'ni addantaani.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Isi magenijooletike haada'ni irkantoole insa'nee dandeette kiphphabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">abindoolenna kutendaan.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Badda'a xeenakana arishsho alfite bira saxxammashshanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">fuggaaleeyye iittanni bira saxxaani.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Hidduwwinna kinoti hana mirqemmaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">lumolla kinoxxe oddo'ni e'yaan.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Mitti manji bakka isexxeen isee gosheele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">hexxemmabi ege'nemmabaan.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Konne qicinni tinni badda'a baggaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">weli hiddichchuwwinna bakkate'n lataan.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />«Mageni fuggoxxenaa'n bayyateeka manna hune walabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">fuggaaleeyyetanna gargaarabaani.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Tennexxee ati gammadda'ni osoldattoshshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">ililissattoshsha assaani.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Atee gibaake manna'ni kinni shooko oddeessaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">fuggaaleeyyeti duunkaaninna ba'aani» hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Iyyoobi hiisse'e haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />«Eeti! Ani tinni dhugaate kaddeexxa eg'eneenneni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">yanne kinni Mageni edo manji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">hitta qullichcha kada dande'a?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:17">Iyo. 4:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Isoo ayyi morome dande'e?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">Isi kuma qortuma qoreele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">konne giddii'ni mitte dande'e hisaaki hedhebaani.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Mageni beekakenna hunnaameessakeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">ayyete Isi hiyyeexxa gibe midhemebaaki gataaki?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Dedhange'ni koobuuwwa linqi linqi assaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">mufateexxinna fottossaan.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Mageni butta isexxe bakkanaa'n lele'misaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">ise itti hana hexxemmaxxa kinuwwanna sheke sheke assaani.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Arishsho fuldabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">urjuwwatinna iffaabaashsha hoyya dande'ani<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Ayyeenna gargaarsa laqedhebaang iima dhiseeki isoteni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">Isi abbaayatike danbala'i hana tarkaafata'nee me'ani<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:25">Mat. 14:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Bakalchakanna wele iima duuchchi darre'n hexxexxa urjuwwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">dadeeki Magenoken.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Isi hujaaxxa lumolluwwa yaanuwwa laakkoonee dhaqqanbabaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">Isi assaaxxa mambe'a yaanuwwanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">tennete hinee egenne birrabaani<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Mageni ani birii'ni sa'eelenna afabo'noni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ani biri'a dageelenna konnete hiyye egenabo'no.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Haseechcho adhdhoole ayyinna hoyye dande'abaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">ayyinna, ‹Mayee iitta assitata'ette hiyye› isoo qora dande'aaki hedhebaani<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Mageni mufatoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">Re'aabi hinaake Abbaayyati bininchixxa gamuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">lekka isixxi hunda sa'aani.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />«Anita, iso'ni hitta hisse'e dande'e haaso'anno?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Iso maa hiyyee moromanno?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Qullichchake kadennelenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">murte uwwaaki Mageni ani'a mararaashsha soodatanno malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">Iso'ni hisse haaso'abo'non.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Ye'edhee'na laqe'e hisse haso'eelenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">hiyyannoxxa caqasse hiyabo'no<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Hobonbalteti ane'e enqe butuchcheen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">ittani, tola boddichchanga anee madeesse bireen.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Hafuuranganni inqo adhdhonaa walebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">abari ane'ni bira saxxaashsha asseen.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Afennexxe hunnani isinni wa'laanichcho abixxano hiyyabe'noshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">isoo geyaaki hunnaameesi hedheba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">murtetixxe songo'n morome'e ifinaa'n hiissedhanno hiyyabenoshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">isoo murtetibaa dande'eexxi iyyedagaak hedheba'a.<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Ane'ni mitte balleessanna gori hedhebaani; yane kinni aningi haaso'i anee balleesanjoke assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">anke afo'onaa'n fuldeexxe duuchchiinxe Mageni ane'ni muraan.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />«Balleesssa ane'n hedhagophphoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ta'inni elqi'a ifi xexxe'atabo'noni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">hedhotinna ane'e gibisse'en<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />‹Mageni balleessaakanna balleessa afebaaka bira'emmaxxee›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">duuchchiinxi mittendeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">hiyyenneki tennexxeeteni.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Balleessa afebaaki manji mitte rakkonni dedhange'ni reyaawodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">Isi konee manjicho'ni oso'laani.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Mageni butta fuggaaleyyetixxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwe'eni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Isi hayyooletixxa ille abideeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">tenne'e asseeki Magenoke kadagophoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">ayyeteta?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />«Bari aniki mitte gammachchiissa'neexxa yaane udebo'noki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">wiinamee sa'a'neeni.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Isinna qoocceti gisinemmaxxe hoboloshsha gonga'neeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">woyi bute adhdhammake sinbirishshanna wiinama'neen.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />‹Gungunso waalee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">mittele gammade'e oso'lanno› hiyyonnolenna,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />Mageni ane'e ati balleessa affeboxxoni hiyyagophammaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">dhibonna rakko ane'ni kexxaaxxee sodaata'ennen.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Yoona balleessanjoke kade lellennechchinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">tola maayeta eelo'anno?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Biso anika saamunik anshedhe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">angatanna haranjiki ca'a assedhonnolenna,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />Seemma anixxi midde anee jibbitaa qico'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">bale giddi'a anee darbitetten.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />«Isi anishsha manjoke kada gopheemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">murtetixxe songo'ni mare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">weli hubanto hiyya dande'abe'no.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />No'oo lamiingee murte uwwaaki hayyichchi afemuummadu! <verse eid="JOB 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Qaaro ifikenni anee bararassabaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">ifike kutinni Mageni anee gana waaleele,<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Ani manni anee hedenneshsha kada gopheennaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">isoo sodaatebe'nong haaso'annan.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />«Hedho anee gibisseeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">anee gubba'neexxa yaane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">mitte gatisebe'nongi haaso'aanneni<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Mageno hiyyaana qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">Atee balleessennelchcho kuli malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ane'ni murtoxxe'e.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Anee konne qico rakissetexxi maa alfitatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">Fuggaaleeyyetike yaada'ni gammada'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">atixxe anganni daddetteka manjo anee salphissatto?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Atixxi ille no'oxxishshatee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Yookini manji uudaashsha ati uuddatto?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Woga atixxi manjiinxishsha harumaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">bari atiki manjiinkishsha heenokee?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Balleessa anixxa mayyee uudda'ette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">Anika dedha mayee hordofatto?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Balleessanjoke kadebe'noxxanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">atixxe anganaa'ni ayyinna anee dande'eexxi gatisabaaxxa atinni egende'etteni.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />«Anga atixxenni atinni anee dadde'e giissitetteni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">ta'ata ettene atixxe anganninni wirri assitee anee balleesitaatte?<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Faariinke miyishsha anee buttinakenaa'ni giissitettexxa qaabbati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">ta'ata, buttinake kadonnaa wirri assite anee bulleessitottaatee?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Munde adotishsha ittichchite'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">anixxe ama godobi giddo anee dadde'e<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Biso anika maalikinna gogiki buqqe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">miqetinna hidduwwiki mitteba abidissette<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Lubbo ani'a uttee anee eteetten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">heqqa atixxeni anee hedhoti uggiteete.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />«Adana tennee yaane duchcha godobi giddo sho'exxeetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">tennee assitottanna mudhdhiteettaxxee kaddeexxa, ta'a ege'nenne<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Balleessa hujaannole mufeti gandottaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">anee dooyyita'etten<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Cubbo hujoonnole ikkiwoddi rakkote'ni ibba'enne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">eloxxa hujoonnolenna ulfinna alfabo'noni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">yaaddoti cuqurto'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">shooko odo'waa'ennen<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Holanno hiyyinnole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">neenqiinsha anee adanda'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">atixxe lumoxxe hunnanni anee miita'n hexxatton.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Ati atixxa dhugaaka kulaara ane'n iyyedagaton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">mufe atixxanna ane'n bira sa'isittaton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">sannachcha atikanna lebbe lebbe ane'n wocci assittaton.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />«Mageno! Maayee ilemabe'noshsha assagophphette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Ayyinna anee afebaang reyeennele eloxxemmani!<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Dademebe'nong gatuunnadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">ama anixxike godobanaa'n fulenneshshanni mogemeennele woyyamma'a.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Harumake barobaa hedha'enneki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Konne harumake baro'ni ballo'o mittengele inqo gammadonna'a ane'e wocci assi<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Illeema higabo'noke himmi hiyyeekenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">dukana dimma bogibaa me'ebe'no edidarre.<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />Me'aanneki boginna dukkanatike gaaddisikenna seeri hedheba bonnon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">ookko hedheeki ifini dukkanatishshateni.»<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Tsoofaarii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Namaatichchi Tsoofari hiisseexxi hiyyee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />«Konne haaso'i duuchchi'a hiissichcho uwwaaki gophema?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Mitti manji konne qico lallabeexxe'e dhugaatike kada dande'a?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Koo Iyoobi! Kunni ati lallabbaateki lallabi no'o haaso'a kuteechcho fakkaate?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Konne qico duchcha no'o'ni geerartatto wodda atee xixaaki hedhebaachcho labbe?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Yaadiki Mageno, ‹ani dhugaate'ni hedhenne hiteetteni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">Ani ati edo qullichchakeni› hiteetteni.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Hita eyyanna'a, silanni Mageni ate'ni haaso'eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">dhuugatika hiissichcho ati'a hiisseele!<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />Beekkuminki ori heddoke kademmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Gotti konne orika beekkuma silanni ati'a ifiseele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Mageni ate'e xixe'eki xixichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">xixemiyyo hasissamma jala kadeexxa egendaattani.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />«Mageniinke beekkumika dhi'mo yaada dandeette egndatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Duuchchiinxa dande'aaka Mageno qo'nisse affatto?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Magenokee iima bayyateba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">ati'a kinni dhaqqabbaboxxo iimi darre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Mageni hundike wiidda'ni hexxeexxe yaane ege'ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">atikinni egendeboxxo<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Mageniinki lumminni buttatike lumminni caala lumoken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">abbaayyati caalanna ba'laken.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />«Mageni dage'e atee usureele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">murtetixxe songo'ni iyyemareele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">ayyetei Isoo hoyya?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Mageni dharcha manna eg'needheeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">insa'ne cubbo hunjaawodda sammi hiyye uudabaani<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Gowwi manji beekake kadee hiyyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">biniinchi manjoke kade ileeme hiyyoteni.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />«Kaddo malee, ati kinni qalbeti higgetexxi faaci'witottoletaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">anga atixxanna Mageniinbaa bande'e iso soodattottole,<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Cubbo huja waaldottole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">atike duunkaana'ninna fuggoxxa yaane hexxabaashsha assittottole,<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Ookkone wodda toggi hite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">mitte shooki belo baqqi hite'e uuddattoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">mittelchchi'anna ruphphi hitaboxxonig jabattee hexxaton.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Rakko atixxa duuchcha deete'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">sa'emmake wodi'ishsha qaabbattattoni<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Hedho atixxi saafo'iinxa arishsho caaldee iffa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">dukkanatinna gorsixxe xa'leshsha kaddaan.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Addattettaxxee soda'abelo hexxattoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">Magenikinna atee heqqaammaxxee ruphphi hitaboxxong hafuura adhdhitee nage'iki hexxattoni.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Soda'a belo diiphphe kexxatton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">heddi manni atenaa'n elle alfo'a hasaani.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Fuggaaleeyyetixxi ille affabaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">baanje fullammaki ori duuchchi insa'nenaa'n ba'aani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">insa'nenna udumaa reyotee halchinaani.»<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ookkooni Iyyoobinna hiisse hiyyee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />«Dhugaaten, ha'no beeka mannani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">ha'noobaa uuduma beeki manni hedhaachcho ha'no'ni labbabaani!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Kaddo malee kinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">aninna ha'noo qicika heduma afe'enneni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">hoone orinninna ha'noni butti'a hedhabe'noni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ha'no haasoottineexxa duuchcha ardi duuchchi ege'neexxebaa?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />«Mageni soodachcho anixxa laqe'e hiisseexxe yannaara hexxemmani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ta'a ani, jaaluwwi aniki ane'ni oso'laake kadenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">mitte dedhibelo hedhennaki, qullichi manji manni duuuchchi ane'ni gebaake kadeenneni.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Rakko geltebaa manji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">rakkateeka manjixxa rakko tuffata shoollaxxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">yaane kinni ibbo'a timmi timmi hiyya'neeka ookkoe manjo ha'noo darbtinaan.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Mulqedhaake mannik duunkaani weekamabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">hunna ifixxenni Mageno ajaja'neeshsha hedaakiir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">Mageno mufachchiisaakiir nage'inginni hedhaa'neeni.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />«Yaane kinni biniincha laqi atee barachchiisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">ci'a qor, ate'n kuldaani.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Yookaani buttixxanna woddi'i giddixxa daduwwa hubatte'e uuddee barattatton.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Konnechchuwwi duuchchinaa'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anga Ifixxini tennee asseexxa ege'nebaak hedhee?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Hedho affeexxi dada duuchchinna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">mitte mitte manjixxi lubbo Mageniinxe anga'ni hexxeeni<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Manji ita arrabiki maqe'e xeema busha ege'nammshashanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">manshati haaso'a laqe'e elo yo'oka gargari hiissaan.<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Woggati lummedheeki manji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">beekkuma alfaan.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />«Mageni kinni beekakenna hunna callikeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">Isi mambe'a gorsaallonna ege'naa afeeken.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Mageni diigoole ayyinna hiisse ijaarabaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">Mageni usuroole ayyinna tikabaani<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Mageni xeena ganabashsha assoole caami dagaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">xeena ganaashsha assoole kinni lolaase butta duchcha'ni yaa'aan.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Mageni jaabakenna eeyyeexxa assaakeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">sobaakinna kadi soobemaaki manji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">lamiing anga Isixxe'n hedheen.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Isi hayyoole beekkeumi belo gatisaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">arda galchaammaka mannanna gowwake assaan.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Isi moyanjuwwa insa'nexxe mootenaa'ni dirrise garbake asaaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">motummatixxa seemmanna insa'neenaa'n fulcheexxi garbummatixxa oddeessaani.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Isi qeese qeessummatenaa'ni gatiseexxi shoraani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">arda galchammakaaranna baallomakenaa'n hoyyaani.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Ardi addataammaka manna sammi assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">geedhetanna beekum belo gatisasn.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Hayyoole shokishaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">jajjabbakanna hunna gophisaani<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Dukkana giddo hunda hedheechcho farri asse lellishaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">dukkanna dimmanna ifake'ni jijiiraani<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Isi gargari hexxeexxe gosaka arduwwa lummise'e gurra fulchaani; wirri asse'enna balleessaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">arda bira sa'issaan; ittanni xexxeeraan.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Arda galchammaka manna gowwake asse'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">ori hedhebaxxe qilla gammojje giddo doonisakiyya hinaashsha assaani.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Dukkana giddo titimmisaashshanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">machcho'eemmake manjishsha gatantaraashsha assaani.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />«Tennee duuchcha ille anxenni uudenneni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">mansha anxenninna leqqeennexxi qalbeefateennen.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Ha'no egendinexxa aninna eg'neennenxeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">hara ha'no jala hedhabe'non.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Yaane kinni haaso'i anki duuchchiinxa dande'aake Mageninniteni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">moromaanekinna isinniteni.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Ha'no kinni gowwumma ha'noxxa buyyatee dhaara haasootine'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">akka affebaang ci'loondeexxi woyi fuldammaabaxxe ci'leeyyuwwan.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Silaani sammi hitine'eele!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">Uudaake duuchcha'ni beekkolete fakkaattinaamman.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Anee moronsiisseexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ane'ni gelteexxa balleessa sammi hitine laqqe.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Ha'no isi Mageniinke summi'a dhara haasottina'neechcho labbee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">manjo sobati Mageno eeyyisina'neechcho ha'no'n fakkaattaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Isi'a gamissineebaata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Ha'no isike golabaata?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Mageni dage'e ha'noo hubatee uudeele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">dhuuchchiinxenni qullo fuldinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Manjo sobbinaashsha Mageno sobbinaachcho labbee?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Sho'iki gamissinoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">Mageni ha'noo xixebaaki gattinabaani<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Lumminne Ifikeeninna ha'noo sodaachchiisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">qaaro Ifikenninna ta'anni ha'noo bararassaani<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Mammaassi ha'nooki manjokee woyi fulammabaake qabuxxishshateni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">ha'nooxxi moromanna butuute gatammake faariinke mi'ishshateni.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />«Yoona ha'no sammi hiyye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">haaso'onnaa ani'anna bado uwwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">ookkoneechchi uduma kadda'neexxi feeteexxi kadduuni.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Magnoke'n afo'o fulchedheennaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">anee shiyaaxxa ege'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Tennexxee Mageni anee shiyo'a hasoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ane'ni mitti gataachchi hedhebaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">kaddo malee anixxa yaane iso'oni ku'lannoni<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Cubbichchi manji Mageni edo dande'e shiqa gophaammaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">tennee jabaate assa anixxi anxe fayya'a buutote kada dandeetaan.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Haso'annexxa adda laqqe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">hiyyaannexxanna caqasse<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Ani darree'ni ani hiyyannoxxa duuchcha elo qicinni bukki assedhee shiqeennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">Mageni anee ‹balleessa affebexxon› hiyyaaxxanna eg'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Anee ku'la'neeki hedhoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">moromebe'nong sammi hiyye reyonaa qixxeffateenneni.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />«Ee Gootta! Ati edii'ni sho'omabe'noshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">laqannexxa lame yaane ani'a assi;<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Tininna, anee xixa waal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">bararassitoxxee.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Ee, Magenoo! Edisse'e ati haaso'i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">aninna hiissichcho ati'a uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">yookaani ani haaso'e'naa ati hiissichcho ani'a uwwi<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Egeri hujennexxi cubbonna balleessa hitteexxe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Dedha hujennekanna cubbo anxa ane'ni kuli.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Alba anenaa'n hoyyexxe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">naaphiinshsa anee uddeteki mayeete?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Diidallo adhdhite me'itammake shafishshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">bagoke huurishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">anee gussite shorrita'ni sodaachchissa'ettelchchi maayeete?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Anee ku'ltotta'a borreessiteettexxi yaane yo'oshsha qararteexxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">bire oosummati wodda hujennexxa balleessa midde ani'a waaldebexxon.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Munnuqqi hiyyabe'noshsha lekka anixxa jirmuwwake'n usurte'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">tarkaaffe anixxa duuchcha uudda'nee anee to'aatta'etten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:11">Iyo. 33:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />«Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa aloo'eechchishsha kadee gatannon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">bile itteexxe seemmashshanna ba'annon.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />«Manjiinke beltixxi wogga harumaxxen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">ittinni rakko callixxen.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Bada'atike daraarishsha leelle'e rake ba'aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">gaaddiddotishshanna turebaang sa'aan.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Mayeeta at iitta hedhennexxa dada anee manjo hordoffa'etteki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Murte ane'n uuttotaa songo anee shiqishshatto?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Batto'eechchonaa'n ca'ichchalchcho afa dande'aak manji hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Mittikinna midde dande'aak hedhebaan!<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Manji hedhaaxxa wogga ati edonni murteettexxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">laakkossa isekanna egendee birteeten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">atixxe murtexxe woggaxxa gabala sa'aaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Maallaqakee mannakee hujaaki manji huje biraa wodda gammadammashshan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">manji hucce galaake baro'ni gammaduun waal.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />«Haqichchi karemoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">kichcho tutunjokenaa'n lata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">damuwwatanna haaroba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">daddadha dande'aan.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Hiddi isiki buttini giddo ture cimoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">kunni hiddi buttini giddo alo'oole,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />Shamina wodi'inka alfoole langaxxe quuxxisaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">wele haaroke haqichchishshan damuwwa fulchedhaan.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Manji kinni reye gataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">reyeechchinni udumi'a haba afema?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Abbaayyati wodi'i bage xo'o hiyyammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">galaniki wodi'inna bagammashsha;<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />Iittanni manji reyeechchi udumi'a langaxxa higabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">iima saxxaa qico'n diiphemmanba gataan.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />«Silaani anee reyeemmaki manni hedhammaba shoxxeettele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">mufe balleeffattato qico'n leella gopheennelenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ookkoo'n anee qaabbattattoxxa barra kuldeettele.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Isi manji reyeechchi uduma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">higee hedhoti hedha'neechcho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Hafuura adhdhannoxxi yaanna daggaa qico'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">konnee rakkotikanna abariinka baro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">oosse sa'annon.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Ookkone wodda atinna anee yexxatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">aninna hee hiyyannoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">dada atinxa anee uudotta'a yortattoni.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Ookkone wodda anxe takkaarroxxa faana qortatton,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">kaddo malee cubbo anixxa heddabexxon.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Usurre hunnemeemmake korishsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">balleessa anixxa duuchcha anenaa'n fuggusitatton;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">cubbo anixxanna ani'a birtatton.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />«Tenne butta'n kinni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">kooba tiggaaxxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">kinjikinna ifixxe bakkanaa'ni fottoqaaxxa,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />Wodi'i kino qote birammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">lola'i yo'oki buttina anshe birammashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">atinna iittanni addatammalchchonaa'n manjo hanqissatton.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Mittele hunnati isoo injifatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">isoonna ibeeba gonphaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">bifa isixxa jijjiirte'e ifi edii'n hoyyitatton.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Oose isixxa manni ulfeessa'nuu ege'neba'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">ardi insa'nee fuggoxxa hiyya'noolenna afaba'a.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Isii ege'neechchi biso ifikixxe dhibo callan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">ifixxe rakko calli'a oodhaan.»<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Langaxxe Yaannaxxa Moronsha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1—21:34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Eelifaazii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Teemaanike bogki manji Elifaazi hiyye hiissee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />«Isi beeki manji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">diidallotishsha umo eege egennebaaka haaso'a haaso'aa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">Godob giddo la'o afebaaka yaada aabixxa?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Beeki manji isi mitte woyi fuldabaaxxanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">gumma affebaaxxa moronsha moroma?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Ati Mageno manni sodaatabaashsha assitetteni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">Mageno sodataake manni'a gufote kaddeetten.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Balleesanjoke kaddettexxa haaso'ange'n ege'nishshaatten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">yaane kinni qarummatike haaso'inni buqqe saxxottaa wo'laanda'etten.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Anke afoo'inni atee balleesanjoke hiyyebo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">yaane kinni haaso'i atingi balleessanjoke kaddettexxa ege'nishaa'nnen.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />«Manjo duuchchanaa'n edisse ilende'etteki atetee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Koobuwwa dadendebaa edi darre ilendeetta'a?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Mageni ifixxe iimixxe songo'n maa mari'ateexxa laqqeetta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Manjiinke beltonaa'n beeki atee calla hiyyotebaata?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />No'o egennennexxi gadhi darre egendeettexxi heente?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">No'o anfeebe'noxxi, yaane kinni ati calli affeettexxi heente?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Atike anni'a edissaaxxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">arrooteexxi geedhuwwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">yaadiki no'onninni welti hexxeen.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />No'o darree'n Mageni ate'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">haaso'e jajjabeessa'neexxi atee geltabaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Godobiki mayee welebaa me'itatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">Mayeete no'o'ni ille fulichita'etteki?<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Magenoke'n mufatteetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">tennexxee elobaaka afo'o Magenoke'n fulchiteetten.<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />«Manji ca'ichchake kada dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">Manjiinki belti qullichchake kadaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Mageni midde ifixxa erganna adatabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">wele waalin iimatixxi iimuwwanna isixxe ille'ni luqqittetebaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />Batto'e cubbo wodu'uffa ha'wa'neek manji fa'i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">hittata ca'a hiyya dande'a?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 25:4-6">Iyo. 25:4-6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />«Ani hiyyaannexxa caqasi ati'a ifisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">uudennexxanna ate'ni haaso'annon,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />Beekkole annuwwa ifikenaa'ni adhdhiteexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">aninna ege'nennexxara kula'enne caqasi.<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Mageni boga insa'ne calli'a uwweemman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">wele gosaki ardi insa'neexxe oddo'n makemeemmabaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Manjo miica'n tureeki fuggichchi manji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">lubboti hedheeke baro duuchcha'n rakata'nee hedhaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Baraarassitaxxa yaane calla manshati laqaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">nage'iinxe yaana'inni isoo mulqedhaaki dagaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Hashsha fule'e nage'iki higaachcho fakkaatabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">shinno'a isoo bagediki heqqinaa'neechcho labbaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Alaattetike afo'o'ni ibo'a gonga'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">reyaaxxi itti dukkanto barra gelteexxa ege'naan.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Dedhange'n bogi iso'n dukkanaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">mitti moyanji lolo'a qophpheeffatee'naa yaadammake manjishsha yaaddonna rakko iso'n bira saxxaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Tinni duuchchi kaddeechchi, Magenoke'n jallateen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">duuchchiinxa dande'aaka Gootta shollisheen.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Shollishee qicinna jabaxxanna ba'laxxa wonte abixxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">ifi duke'e isi boonchi'a guule daga'neeten.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />«Alba booneexxi finniso'edheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">hidhakanna furdatee wo'meedheen.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Kunni manji diigemeeke qachchuwwa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">onuwwake'inna ibo'a dooqemmake minuwwi giddo hedhaaken.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Duroomatabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">karra isixxinna galdabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">buttate'ninna ba'latabaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Isi reyotixxe dukkananaa'n fulabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">giiratiki bubenji qoorseemmake haqichchixxe damuwwashshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">shafa diidallo harcaassemmake haqqichchishshaten.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Is umo ifike ani lumoke hiyye hedaa'n ifi soboqqe'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">tennenni la'o alfaaxxi hexxabaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Yanna geltebaang bagammakenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">damuwwa isixxi hanjexxammabaake haqichchishsha kadaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Raxxaaxxi yaanna geltebaangi harcaatammaxxe woyinetixxe gummashshanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">daraari harca'ammake ejersiinke haqichchishsha kadaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Mageno ulfeessabaaki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">sanne belo reyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">matta adhdhaake mannik duunkaananna giirate ittaan.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Rakko ciniinfante fuggoxxa illaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">godobi giddo xaqaro hendaani.»<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Iyyoobinna hiyye hiissee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />«Konnee fakkaataaka haaso'a heddole laqeenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">ha'nooxxi jajabeessa rakkote lebbeen.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Isi ha'no ca'li hitinee haasottina'n hexxina'naata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Aninni morondina'n haasottinaashsha asseengechchi maachcho?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Ani ha'noote kadee'naa ha'no anete kaddineele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">tuffeti umo ha'no'ni le'misa'nee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Ha'no ta'a hitineexxa duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">aninna ha'no'ni giisse haaso'annan.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Iittanni ha'noo jajjabeessateenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">gammachchiisatee heddo elolla haaso'a haaso'annan.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />«Yaane kinni haaso'onnolenna dhibo anee waalda'neba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">sammi hiyye ossonnolenna anenaa'n shollexaba'a.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Mageno! Hunna anee hoyyitette;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">anka mini hadonna birtette.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Anke bisixxi shonqoroora beessisake kaddeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">huqqinni ankinna cubbichchake kadennexxa kula'neen.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Mageni mufate'e biso anka kukkute;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">jibbe'e isso ane'ni ga'medhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">naaphi ankinna ille ane'ni goshe.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Manni ane'n bukki hiyye'e afo'o ane'ni cabbedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">cee'mina'ni anee kabale.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Magen anee fuggaaleeyyetixxenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">xaqartiyyetixxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwe.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Nage'inginni hedha'ennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">yaane kinni Mageni mufate'e anee bulleesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">gooba anee hudhee butti'a darbe'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ane'ni alaame.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />Gabet lolammaki manni ane'n gumeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">marartebelo kalattuwwa anxa ote kochchise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ha'lootto anxanna butta dhangalaase;<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Ege'nemeeke shiyallishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">anee wowoxxe kochchise.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />«Yaadeennaxxee jooniyya seemma odo'wennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">buttinake'ninna wabbi hiyyenne.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Odhishshatenaa'ni kexxeexxa albi anki duuchchi diimmate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">gaari illetiki afabo'noshsha anee buqe.<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Tinni duuchchi kaddee wodda ayye'ninna fuggoxxa assebe'noni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">Mageno ca'itte qalbenni soodata'ennen.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />«Ane'ni geltexxa bake tennee butta shoxxoxxe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">Dhugaatee raarennexxi raarenna buqende gattaashsha assitoxxe'e!<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Ani'a dhugaa kulaakinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">ani'a baasse'e haaso'aaki iima hedheeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:25">Iyo. 19:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Jaaluwwi anki anee cee'meen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ani kinni Magenonge'ni oodhannon.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Lame manjixxa yaane afe'e araarsammake manjishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">silaani manjinxanna Mageniinxa yaane afe'e araarsaaki hedheele.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />«Bari ankinna muda'ni me'a'neeni me'ine hingabaabaa me'onna'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">heenoxxe wogga calla gattaani.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Hafuura afebe'noni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">hedhaanneki barinna haru'meedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">baletinna ani'a ummende'e qophphotteen.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Anee oso'laaki manni boga duuchcha wo'meeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">anee miina'neexxanna uudeennen.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />«Ee Magenoo! Anxe yaane'ni atee malee haaso'aaki hedhebaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">atinni calli ani'a annake kadi.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Hende egennabaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">heduma insa'neeka duuchchiteetteni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">tennexxee anee injiffantaashsha assitaboxxoni.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Alfaaxxe la'oxxee hiyyeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ifika jaalo sa'isseexxi uwwaaka manjo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">isixxe oosexxi ille baxxa.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />«Mageni anee manji geebaake manjo asse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">manni ane'n cirqataake manjo kadenne.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Yaadotenaa'ni kexeexxa ille anee jululli hiteeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">qa'late'e gaaddiddote kadenne.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />No'o dhugaatikeni hiyya'n hedaammaaki manni alaayyeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">no'o qulliyyeteni hiyyaammaki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">anee fakkaataake Mageno ulfeessabaake manjo'ni mufateeni.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Qullichchi manni dhugaatenaa'ni gorabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">Mageniinki manninna hunnande'nni hunna lephpha'nee me'aani hinaa'ni hendaani.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />«Duchchiingi higgeenna daginne'e edishsha haasottineele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">ha'no giddii'ni mitte beeka midde afabo'noxxa ege'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Bari ankinna mude'eeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">yaadi ankinna anxe qalbexxi halcha tola gatteen.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Kunni manni hashsha barrate hiyya'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">ifa kinni dukkanate hiyya'neen.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Konnechchinni edi'a heqedhdhaanneki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">mini anki hirreessakeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">ma'na anxa dukkana giddo fa'annoni.<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Hirreessi, ‹Anke anna,› kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">anee ittaaxxi corroquwwa, ‹Anixxe amanna anixxe dayyo,› kandaan.<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Anita addatannolchchi maachcho hedhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Ani'a kaddaaxxa yaane uudaakita ayyete hedhe?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Addatannolchchi aninni welti bale giddi'a me'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Mitteba aninni hirreessi giddi'a e'yaa?»<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Beldaadii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Shuha hiyyemaake bogiki manji Bilidaadi hiyye hiissee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Mayeete haaso'a bira sa'issitaatteki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">No'onna haasonno; sammi hite'e caqasi.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Mayeete ati no'oo mittelchcho ege'nebaake horishsha assitaatek?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">gowwiinshanna mayye no'oo uuddaattek?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Mufattottole atende ifi miitatooni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">ati mufattettexxee Mageni butta duwwi gatisaba'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Atixxe mufe'a kinjjuwwwa hedhemabaa'ni lele'misabaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />«Fuggaaleessi manjixxi hedho xassiinsha baxxaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">langaxxa xabammabaake giiratike bubenjishshaten.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Isi ifi xo'eeke minsha kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">xabamak xassinna xo'aan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:17">Iyo. 21:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Tarkaafatammaxxa hunna gophaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">mannakee heddammaxxi fuggonna isoonni ibaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Ifiixxe lekanni mareexxi fonxorote'ni e'ye gangalataan;<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Fonxorotinna lekka isixxa abiddeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">silli assitaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Buttinake'n wodaro isi'a fayende'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">me'aake ora'ninna fonxoro uggende'een.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Qarqara isike'n sodaachchiissaaxxi yaane gunde'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">isoo udumii'ninna hordoffa'n shorrita'neen.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Isinna solo'ik hunna gophaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">jabaxxe rakko'ninna ibaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Bisi isiki alagonpheti huqqataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">reyotinna isoo adhdhitaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Na'ge'iki hedhaammake duunkaaninaa'n xuqqi hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">manjo duuchcha'n mooteexxi iitti reyo iso'n geltaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Mini isik giddo mittilchchinna gataachchi hedhabaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">Isike galduma'ninna diin fifixendaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Isi, hundii'n hiddi bagee'naa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">shafuwwi harca'emmake haqichchishsha kadaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Buttate'n isoo qaabbaataaki hedhabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">summi isikinna buttatenaa'n ba'aan.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Isi lubboti hedhaammake mannixxe oddo'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">ifakenaa'ninna dukkanatibaa hunemaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Ifike ardi giddii'ni ila belo gataan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">isike mine'ninna ofoldaaxxi isixxi ila hexxabaan.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Boroti darrekinna dhidhimi darreki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">iso'n gelteexxa rakko laqeexxi alaayye qexer hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Woldonni fuggaaleeyyetee uudu'maachchi konnenden;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">Mageno sodaatabbaake mannixxinna tennenden.»<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyoobinna hiyye hiissee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />«Haan qico'n micco anka enqitina'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">yaaneti anee rakkissina'n hexxinna?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Higgina'ni anee yowwitinaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">shookkinabaa?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Balleessonnolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">balleessa itti anende miitaa malee ha'notebaan.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Ee ha'no ifi saaddine'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">rakko tinni iso'ni gelteechchi isixxe balleessa'aten hitinoolenna,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Yaane kinni tennee rakko duuchcha ane'ni geessiseekinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">anee abido'a fonixoro fayeeki Magenoken.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />«Rakkatennen hiyye'e ku'lennele ane'e afaak hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">hafuura gikki asse'e raarenen dhuga'a alfebo'no.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Mageni ora duuchcha duuchcheemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">sa'annob hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">tarkaafatannobanna dukkanseen.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Karra anxa duuchcha anenaa'n mulqe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">gurra ankanna balleessen.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Duuchchin darree'ni anee mikite bireen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">addete'e edi'a kaddaan hiyyannalchchi haqichchinsha anenaa'n fotoqaashsha asseen.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Mageni mufate anee gane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">naaphiinshanna anee uude.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Anee gano'a sannachcha ifika ergee'na'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">mine anki bira riphe anee buqe.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />«Mageni dayyuwwi anki duuchchi anenaa'n bayyataashsha asse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">ege'neek duuchchinna anee keessummatishsha uude.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Firi anenaa'n bayyateen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">jaaluwwikinna anee dedhe.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Keessumma adhdhee mine galchedhenneki duuchchi anee dedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ani'a ergattammaxxi dubarte duuchchi anee mannake assite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">alagiinshanna uudde.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Erganjo anka ye'onnole cuqqi hiyyaba'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">kadhate'e nu'u hiyyonnolenna anxa laqaba'a.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Are anxi foole anka diqatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">dayyuwwi aningiri anee boshshedhe.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Oose midde anee tuffatteen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">anee uudda woddanna osoldeen.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Lubbotik anki jaaluwwi duuchchi anee boshshedheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">yo'oshsha eyyaannakir duuchchi qophphi hiyye'e ane'n ke'e.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Maali mudee'naa'a miqete kade'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">dhikke calla gatenne.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />«Koo anke firaa! Anee ganeeki Magenoken,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">maganneten ani'a marrarre! Meenn ani'a jabaatte!<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Magenonge anee rakkiseeni ha'no maayee anee rakkissina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Ta'i qico'ni anee geebbineexxi geltabaata?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />«Ta'i qico'ni haaso'ennexxa yaane qaabbateexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">maxaafake'n borreessaak hedheele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">hittata eyyanna'a!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Silaan sibliinke mi'inninna irsaaseti borreessende'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">yookaan boo'etika kinjo bocati hana borreessende'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">duuchchi woddi'a hexxaashsha assendeele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">hittatta eyyanna'a!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Yaane kinni anee wodaaki iima hedheexxanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">udumixxe yaanna'n anee gargaaro'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">buttate'n dageexxi uurraaxxa ege'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Goga anka dhukkubi ite biroolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">konne bisinninni hedhe'e Mageno uudannoxxa ege'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Isoo umoo aningenninni ani uudannoken</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">Ille anxinna isonde uuddaan; welekebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ettene barra yo'oshsha halcha'eennen.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />«Anke firaa!, ‹anee aallattinee rakkisatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">tenne rakkoxxi buuto isondeni hitine› haasotinoole,<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Mageniinxi mufe wolaantichchiinxa mura woxxisa iyyedaggammaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">wolaantichchiki muddinabaashsha heqqedhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Mageni muraake kadeexxanna ege'ne.»<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Tsoofaarii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Na'imake bogiki manji Tsoofaari hiisse hiyyee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Ati hitettexxi yaane anee gubbeexxi haaso'annoshsha assiteen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">tennexxeeten haaso'oonna'a hoxemaannek.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Haasottaatta wodda duuchcha anee yowwitaattan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">kaddo malee hiyyennexxi hiissichcho ati'a uwwanno qico anende ege'nennen.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />«Mageni manjo buttate'n hedho'a uggeexxe yaanna'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">olmii'ni telchchi qico'ni iittande kaddeexxa egendeetten.<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />Fuggichchi manjiki gammadi harumaxxe yaanna'aten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">Mageno addatabaake manjiki gammadinna xu'u geyebaang ba'aaken.<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Fuggichchi manji ifi duke'e hollati iima Mageno geyoole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">qeerredhenna umiki iimixxa huurre tuqoolenna,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />Ifike foole'ishsha ijje ba'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">isoo eg'neemmak duuchchinna, ‹Isi haba hedhe?› hiyyaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Oojjoti leelliteexxi baxxammaxxe yaaneshsha phirri hiyye ba'aan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:8">Hashshixxe waleellashshanna iikki woddi ba'aan.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Hedhdhamabaa'ni coxxe isixxa gonphammaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">mittele isoo uudeeki langaxxa isoo afabaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Oose isixxi manna sobatta'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">anni hiyyeeyyetenaa'ni dabiki adhdheemmaka maallaqa hiissitaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Ka'umummati wo'ma hedhemmaki isiki bis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">shiixxoxxe yanna uduma buttinake kadaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />«Fuggichchi fuggoxxa ifike afo'i giddo itaatishsha xe'mi'lshoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">ifixxe boqo giddonna isee sho'edhoole,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />Liqinsebaang afo'i giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">isee corqa'n tuursoolenna,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />Yaane kinni liqinsee uduma xe'me itti qaraartee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">godob giddonna buutetixxe ha'lashsha kaddaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Fuggichchi manji iteexxa karra sifeeffatabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">itemmaxxa duuchcha Mageni honqo'ashsha assaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Fuggichchi manji buutetixxa ha'la ha'waani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">bofikina iddee isoo shiyaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Ardake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">malebiinshanna adotishsha duneddaaxxa eebba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">uudebaang reyaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Elo isixxa mannakee hiisse uwwa malee itabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">dadda'le alfemmaxxa karranna la'onfatabaan,<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Tinni iitta kaddeechchi, hiyyeyye miice duuwwi gatise; ijaarebaaka mine mannakenaa'n adhdheemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />«Haphphaaleessake kadeemmaxxee anee gelteen hiyyabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">tuu'leemmaxxi karranna isoo gattissabaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Isi donnake kadeemmaxxee welekee mittelchchona gatisabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">tennexxee isixxi karra kiphattabaani.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Feedhee qicinna dureessake kadoolenna hifo calla kadaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">iso'ni duuchchi wodda rakko bira saxxaani.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Goddee iteenne hiyyaa wodda Mageni mufeti isoo ganaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">ifixxa balanna xeeniinsha iso'n gansisaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Bagedokenaa'ni baaje fuloole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">saggeettotike mogidinni otemaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Ottemaaki mogidinna giddi'a sa'eexxi elqee'n fulaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">qarikinna tidho kukkuta'n gadhi'a xalli hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">isinna alaayye qexeri hiyyaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Tuulemaxxi karra duuchcha dukkana dimma giddo baxxaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">manji uggebaaxxi giira isoo ittaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">isike mini giddo gattaaxxi karra duuchcha gubattaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Hujemmaxxa cubbo iima farri assite kuldaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">buttatinna naaphake kadde'e iso'n kexxaan.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Mageniinxe mufeexxa barra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">isike minixxa karra duuchcha lola'i gudhdhe bukki asse me'aan.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Mageni xaqartyye mureedheechchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">fuggaaleeyyetik qoobbi konneten.»<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s1">Iyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyoobi'nna hiyye hiissee haaso'ee qici:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />«Haaso'anexxa caqqassinoole anee dayyeessitinaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">balloo'o konnee qicinni kadduun.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Mittengele calla haaso'anneni laqqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">konneechchi uduma eetineeshsha oso'le.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />«Ani aallataannek manjokeeta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Osunte bidhdhonole osseba hina?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Mee anee uudde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">haasoottinaachcho gophphinaa qico'ni anxi jiro mekki assitaaxxen.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Aninni hedanno wdda midde jigijigi hiyya'ennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">alayyee roqoonsa'ennen.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Mayeete Mageni fuggaalessi manni qeerraxxa wogga tureexxi, duroome'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">butate'n hedhdhaasha waaleek?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Mayee oosetixxa oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">undaa qico'n yaane insa'ne eldee'naa he'na'neek?<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Mine insa'neeke'n sodaanta'neechchi hedhebaang nage'ik he'na'neen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Mageni mufatee insa'nee gane ege'neba'a<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Hori insa'neeki mitte rakko belo hora'ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">lali insa'neekinna riime'a ibise ege'nebaan.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Oose insa'neexxi gedhebiinxe beltannashsha burraqqa'ni geebbaani.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Okolenna kiraara ganda'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">susuu'le aafuuffa'ni gammada'ni faarsitaan.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Kunni fuggichchi manni nage'iki hedhe'ee baro ifika bidhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">reyaa woddanna nage'iki moogemaan<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Fuggaaleesi manni Mageno!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">‹No'onaa'ni bayyati, atika seera egennonnaa hansaabe'non hiyyaan<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Isoo Magenoofataneek duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Isoo soodaante maa la'o alfinanno?›<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Iitta hina'neechchi horante anfeechchi duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">hunna insa'neexxenni alfineechcho fakkattee'naaten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">ani kinni konnee fuggaaleeyyetika yaada adhdhannokebaan.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />«Haano fuggaaleeyye qooma rerte egende?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Birtaaxxi yaane insa'ne'ni dagge egendee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Mageni mufate insa'nee gane ege'nee?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Insa'nee diidallo huuriinsha adhdhite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">hoobonbaltetinna bukotishsha filte hoyyitee woddi hedhee?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />‹Ha'no Mageni annuwiinxe balleessa'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">oose xixaan› hitinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Yaane kinni Mageni iittinni cubbaaleeyye balleesa ifixxa ege'nexxo'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">insa'neenni umo insa'neenga xixuun;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">iittate kaddeele insa'ne balleessa ifixxa egennamman.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Cubbo hujeeki manni umo insa'neenginninni xixichcho adhdhowwal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">Duuchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni mufate insa'nee ganowwaal<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Manji reyeechchinni udumi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">oose ifixxee heedaaxxi hexxee?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />«Mageni manna galchammange lumolla manna'n muraani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">tennexxeeta Isi hitta muraaxxa Manji iso'ni kulaake?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Mitti mitti manni reyaa qico'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">rakko mitte geltebaang uduudik fayyanni hedhee;<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />Bisi insa'neeki shoonqoqoorebaang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">elo qico galla'in rennaani.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Weli manni kinni elo qico gale'e gammadoke hinaachcho uudebaang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">yaaddot cumuummi hiyya'nee reyaan.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Yaane kinni duchchiing reyee moogemee'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">oolo ittaange callan.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />«Ane miinanno hitine'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">ani'a maldineeka daba ege'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Ha'no, ‹Ookkone lumoke manjik minni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">iikki fuggichchi manjinna hedhaammak duunkaan haba hedhe?› Hitinaan.<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Ora me'e aagammaka manna qodhdhitinebaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Insa'nee odo adhdhitinabaa?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Insa'ne ‹Mageni mufatee arda gannaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">elobaaxxa assammaki manni nag'iki fuulan› hineen<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Fuggichcha manjo hujexxa elobaaxxe tennete assitette hiyye ku'laaki hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Yookaan xixe'e bado hissaaki hedhee?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Reye uuduma rensha dulkee moongammabaa aa'ne me'inaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">mogiinxa bakka heqqendaan<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Bale giddika buttinna isi'a sense waalaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">mooggiibaa me'inaa wodda heddi manni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">weli edii'ni me'aani weli kinni uudumii'ni hordofaan.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />«Mayeeta ha'no anee woy fulabaake haaso'inni jajjabeessitino'a wo'laandineek?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Hasoottineeki haso'i duuchchi dharaken.»<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Eelfaazi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Teemaanike bogik manji Elifaazi hiyye hiissee qici<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />Manji Magenokee maa woyifula?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Wele waalni beeka manjo kadeexxenna kaddoolenna isi isinge umi'aate malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Magenokee maa leba?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Ati hujjettexxi eloxxi huje duuchchiinxa dande'aake Mageni'a maa lebba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Yookaan dedhi mitte belo atixxi hedha isi'a maa lebba?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:6-8">Iyo. 35:6-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Isi ate'n muureechchinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">iitta atee xixeechchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">ati isike jaalo kaddettexeetee?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Tinni duuchcha ate'ni gelteek fuuggichcha manjo kaddettexxeetenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">cubbo bira saxxeexxa hujjettexxeetebaa?<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Dayyuwwa atikee liqeessitetteke maallaqi'a seeri belo abdinsaashsha assitetten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">welekanna seemma mulqexxe adhdhite duwwi gatissetten.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Soolo'we dheebote shaqeekee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">ite ha'waachcho uuteboxxon<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Ati fichcha insa'neeka hunnaameeyye jaaluwwa atikee uutetteni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">ati kinni tennee assatee hunna affeetteni.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Aro'i reyeexxa melaalluwwa gargaara gibbetten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">anna affebaaxxe oosuwwaka galdumanna balleessiteette<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa kunseten fonxoro qarqara atik'ni fayendeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">deedhanige'n qexeri assaki alayyi ate'n dage'n<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Bogi ate'n duukkanee'naa affaboxxon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">loola'ikinna atee buqeen.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />«Mageni iimati iimi darre hedhaakebaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Uurjuwwa iima hexxeexxe kaddoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Mageni kinn uurjuwwati immi darre hedhe isee butti'a uudaan<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Ati kinni ‹Mageni maa eg'ne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Duumanchi isoo buuqeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">maa afee no'o'n mura?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Tenne dhisendeexxe iima hana mammaremaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">duumanchi isoo afa kuteen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">afabaan hiteetten›<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Cubbaaleessi manni galaammake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">edike galduma'ni galatee eeteette?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Insa'ne rennaxxi yanna geltebaang renneen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">mine lola'i fottosse aadhe me'ammashsha fottonqeen<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Insa'nenna duuchchiinxa dande'aaka Mageno, ‹No'onaa'ni bayyati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">maa no'aa assitatto?› hine.<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Kaddo malee kinni mine insa'neeke'n qabeenna wonsheeki isoten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">tennexxe ani konne'e fuggaaleeyyetika yaada adhdhannokebaan.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />«Mageni fuggaaleessa manna'ni muree'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">qajeeli manni uudaa wodda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">gammadaan oso'la'ni hiyyaa qici,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‹Mageni no'oka naapha dhuugandin balleesse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">karra insa'neexxe duuchcha'ni giira wore hiyyaan.›<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />«Tennexxe koo Iyyoobi, amo Mageniki araarende'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">jaalo atike assedhdhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">iitta assitoottole, Mageni atee eebbisaan.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Mageni atee barisiissa'neexxa barachcho adhdhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">hiyyichcho isikanna godoba galchedhi.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Duuchchiinxa dande'aake Magenibaa higgottole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">edo hexxetta woddishsha kaddatton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">fuggoxxa huja atike duunkaananaa'n bayyisottele,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />Worqe bukote'n hundottole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">Ofiirixxa worqenna wodii giddike kinjishsha darbittotole,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Ookkone wodda duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni ati'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">worqetanna ca'ichcha birreti sibiljo kadaan<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Ookkone wodda duuchchiinxa dande'aake Mageno'n gammadatton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">isinni welti mittoondattoni.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Isoo soodattatto wodda soodachcho laqaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">soodatetexxa duuchcha laaqaammxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">wereega isi'a uutattoni.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Hujjottaa heddeettexxi duuchcha ati'a qaajeeldaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">me'itattoke ora duuchcha'n ifi ati'aa ifaan<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Mageni hollaameyye shookishaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">salphatemmaka manna kinni gargaaraan<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Anga attixxi qulloomatenaa'ni kexxeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">cubbaleeyye fayyitaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">nage'ikinna me'itaani.»<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Iyyoobinna hiyye hiissee qici:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />«Ta'anna lumoxxe yadonninna aalachchonni hedhenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">oodhdha'ni raaronnolenna; ta'anna Mageni anee ganaa walebaan.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Isi afemaaba eg'nennele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">hedhaa'neeba mare geyennele hitta eyyanna'a!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Yaane anixxanna iso'ni ku'laannan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">amme ballessa afebo'noxxa taakka langanna hiyya'n haaso'aannan.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Maa hiisse'e ane'ni haaso'aaxxa uudannan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">maa hiyyaaxxanna laqaannan.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Eega, Mageni isixxe lumoxxe hunnanni anee ganuun?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Waawwo'o; yaane kinn haaso'aannexxe laqaa malee, ganabaan.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Ani mitte balleessa afebo'no manji ookko isinni moromannoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">hayyichchi ank Magenkinna ‹balleessa affeboxxo› hiyye ane'ni muree duuchchi woddi'a anee leexxa fulchaan.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />«Yaane kinni isika hasito boroti darre'n marennen ookko hedheebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">dhidhimmi darre'inna wirri hiyyennen afa gopheen.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Isi middi darre'n huje hujate'n hedheen ani kinni afabo'no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">bita'i darre'inna wirri hiyyennen afa gophenneni.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Isi taakkaarro anxe duuchcha ege'neen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">hega anee uudoolenna worqeetishsha ca'aa hiyye giddii'n fulannon.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Isi eeyyake ora'ni me'enneni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">elqenna kayya daaqebo'noni.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Ajaja isiki gadhi darre fulabo'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">hiyyichcho isikanna godoba ank giddo uggudheennen.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />«Murte muraki isonden isoo hoyyaakinna hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Isi haaseexxa duuchcha assaan.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Ane'n kaddoo'a hedeexxa duuchcha muuxaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">konnee fakkaataaka heddo yaaduwwanna afeen.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Tennexxe isi edo uurratee yo'oshsha sodata'ennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">tennee hedanno wodda midde alayya'ennen.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Magen godob ank culphisaashsha assee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">duuchchiinxa dande'aki Mageni anee alalshe.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Dukkana dimmi anee buqqe'e afabo'noshsha assoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">dukkanatixxi birasa'ne anee haaso'a hoyyitebaan.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />«Duuchchiinxa dande'aak Mageni maayeete murte uuwwaaxxa yanna mura gophpheechchi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Ardi isiki isi cubbaaleeyyete'ni muraaxxa barra haani qico'n heqqedha'ni hedha?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Fuggaaleesi manni gabala balleesa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">moodheeka gedhebonna alla'linaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Anna affeebaaxxe oosexxa harre hunnat adhdhineen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">aro'i reyeexxe manjichchoka qotiyyichcho liqakee abixxineen.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Hiyyeeyye xireeffante ora me'itabaasha hoyyine'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">insa'ne edii'n baanje sho'ommaashsha assinaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Hiyyeeyye qiilla gammoojje biniinchishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">ifixxe oose'a ittaachcho hasito doonsa kiyya hinaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Wele manni'a hunja'n midha bukk assina'nee aassinaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">fuggichchi manjika woyinetike hiddichchike fichchanaa'n feshshillaani.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Hashsha duuchcha duwwi diinphe gallaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">boojjetee oddo'winnaaxxa seemmanna anfebaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Koobate'ni ganaaki xeeni biso insa'neeka shanshe biraan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">eebbinjo halsine marre'e kinuwwa hanqalfine gallaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Anni reyeexxa oose uununakenaa'ni kunte ifi'a garbake asse'no'aa mucunqe adhdhinaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">hiyyeessi manjika belto liqakee adhdhinaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Hiyyeeyye seemma afa gophpheemmaxxee duwwinn huje bobbaataan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">Midha aassinaaxxa yanna ladde dukka'ne aassitaan solo'witaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Fuggaaleeyyetike hiddichchike fichchanaa'n ejersiinxa zaayite miiccaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">woyinetixxe gummanninna bulbulo giissitaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">yaane kinni insa'ne dheeboti gubantaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Qachcha qachcha'inni manni reyo shiqee gadooda'neen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">mado'eek manni gargaaro'a raaraan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Yaane kinni Mageni insa'ne'n hunjeeka daba uda'ini ca'li hiyyeen.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />«Ifa gibaake manna hedheen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">ifi maachcho kadeexxa ege'na gonpheemmaxxee ifinka ora me'inabaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Manjo shiyaak manji bogi soodebaang ke'ee rakkiyyenna hiyyeeyye shiyee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">hashsha moorakee fulaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Yababulaaki manjichchi bogi hashshaxxe heqqedhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ayyiinna isoo uudabaashsha alba buqedhaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Moodhalshe hashsha mine undee moorakee e'yitaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">barra kinn sho'ondee hossaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ifa eenabaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Sodaachchisaaxxi hashsha insa'nee gammachiissamaxxe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">dukkanna dimma insa'ne'aa barrishshaten.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />«Kaddo malee kinni fuggaaleeyye ta'a leelle'e iikki woddi ba'ammake wodiinke honbishshaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">fichchi insa'neek gummisabaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">insa'neeke woyinetike hiddichchike fichchi giddi'a maraak hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Kaade eebbinjiki baqqe'e wodi'i bage'e xo'oo hiyyee'naa gonphammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">cubbaaleeyye rerte'e moogendee'na'a gonphaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Ildeexxi amuwwanna insa'nee deetaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">maala insa'neekanna oolo ittaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">fuggichchi manni haqichchiinsha enqemmaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Tinni duuchcha insa'e'ni gelteechchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">ila affebaaxxa melaalle miinceemmaxxeetenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">aro'i reeyemmaaxxa melaalle elooxxa assa gonpheemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Yaane kinni Mageni hunna isixxenni mootummate'ni hedheeka manna hoyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">galdumi insa'neeki elookenna fakkaatoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">reyo gantabaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Mageni insa'nee nage'iki he'neeshsha assoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">me'inaa ora duuchcha uudaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Fuggaaleeyye shiixxooxxa yanna gurra fuldoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">iikki woddi badda'atishsha bange ba'naan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">midhatishshanna haamemmaan.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Iitta kadabaan hiyyondoole dhaarichchake kadennexxanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">dhugaa haso'ebo'noxxa ayyete koka?<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Bilidaadii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Shuha hinaake bogik manji Bilidaadi hiyye hiissee qici: <verse eid="JOB 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />«Mageniinxe mootummaxxi hunna sodaachchissaaxxen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">galcha'neexxa iimanna nage'ik hexxaashsha asseen.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Sannaachcha isikka laako'e dhaqqabaaki hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Ifi isiki ifabaaki ayyi'aate?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Manji Mageni edo qullichchake kada dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Manjoke kade'e hitta ca'ichchake kada?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Magenokee agenji middee wa'a hiyye'e ifabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">urjuwwatinna isi'a ca'ittetebaan.<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Alo'aakinna coroqo'ak manji fa'i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">maachchotaa?»<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyoobinna hiyyee hiisse qici:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />«Hunna afebaa manjo hittata gargaartette!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">gopheeka manjo hittata anjirtette!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Beekkuma afebaakee hitta hedheeka gorsa uutettexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">ege'nebaakee hitta eg'nashsha assitettexxa uudi!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Hitta iitta hasoottotaa dandeettette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Ayyike haffuura atee iitta haasooseek?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />«Abbaayyati hundi darree hedheek reyeemmak manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">lumoxxe soda'anaa'n kexxeexxa culphisate'ni hedheen.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Mageni reyemmaki manni hedhemmaxxa bale giddo duuchcha afaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">mittilchinna isoo gollaachchi hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Mageni middi darrexxa iima isexxe bakka'n dhiseedheeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">buttatanna iittanni duwwixxe bakka'ni rarraate hexxaashsha asseen.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Mageni duummanchi giddo wode'e wonshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">wodiik a'urrenaa'ni kexxeexxa duumechchi dareemabaa.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Isi agenjiink goobani duumencha golashsha assaan.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Ifakanna dukana garigari hiso'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">Abbayyati hana gabala quuqubi asse dhiise giise<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Isi mufate xiixaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">Iima abide'emaki utuphphuwwi girigir hiyyaan.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Isixxe hunnan Abbayya sammi assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">beekkuma isikenni Ra'aabi hinaaka Abbaayya giddika lumoka binichcha balleessaasan.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Hafuura ifika uffu hiyye iima ca'aa assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">anga isixxenninna lootaaxxa jawwe oottaan.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Kunnichchi duuchchi Mageni hujeexxe yaanuwwake haffaaqan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">no'o isixxa yaane hashashote lanqaannen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Mageniinxe hunnaka lumminne tummi assee ayyete ege'na?»<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Iyyoobi higgeenna haaso'ake'n ke'e hiyyee qici: <verse eid="JOB 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />«Dhugaatixxa murte mura gibexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">hedho anixxi ane'ni qaraaritaashsha asseeki duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni ege'neexxa,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />Mageni hafuura ani giddo uge'na'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">hedhooti hedhenne qico,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />Haranga fuggok haaso'i afo'o anikenaa'ni fulabaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">anki arrabi dhara haaso'abaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Ha'no haasoottineexxa duuchchiinxi dhugaaten hiyye haranga adhdhabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">reyannoxxe barra qico'n dhugaatenaa'n mishikki hiyyabo'non.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Dhugaate'n galneshshanni galanno malee walaabo'no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">lubboti hedhenne baro duuchcha tenne yaane'n anee godobi qoxxi hiyyaachchi hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />«Naapha anika cubbaaleeyyetishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">anee gareeraakanna fuggaaleeyetishsha Mageni insa'ne'n muraan.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Mageni lubbo adhdhee baro insa'neeka haruunsaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">Mageno magenoonfatabaak maa kaduu?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Rakko insa'ne'n daggaabaro Mageni oodhishsha insa'neexxa laqaa?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Duuchchiinxa dande'aake Mageno'n gammanda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Yanna yanna'i'n isoo ye'ee'na?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />«Mageni hittee qico hunnameessake kadeexxa ha'noo barachchiisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">duuchchiinxa dande'aak Mageninna asso'a hedeexxa ha'noo sho'abo'non.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Ha'nooqqa tenee duuchcha egendinneenni hexxinee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">maayeeteta tennee woyi fuldabaaxxa yaane haasoottinaachch?»<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />«Duuchchiinxa danide'aak Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">fuggichchakanna xaqartichcha manjo xixaaki konneechchinni butti'a hedhee qicinniten.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Heddo oose afeexxe kaddoolenna bagedik muddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">ila isixinna ittaachcho gophphee so'lo'witaan <verse eid="JOB 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />ookkoo'ni gattemmaxxi dhukkubiki muddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">aruwwa insa'neexxi midde insa'ne'a ooxxabaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Fuggaaleeyye lakkoonne dhaaqanbabaaka bireetika sibiliijo tuu'ltan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">tennete hinabaxxa oddonona afaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />Yaane kinni fuggichchi afeexxa seemma qullyyete oddo'witan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">tuuleemmaaka biretika sibiljo Mageniink manni adhdhaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Ijaadhdhineeki mininna magenijoletikenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">midha heqqe'nammaxxe xeleephphotike fooqishsha diigemaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Fuggaaleessi manji duroomeemmaxxe shene hiyyee diiphaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">dammaqa wodda kinni karra isixxi duuchcha ibbeeba gophaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Lola'i dedhange'n dagee'naa alaanaammashsha dedhange'n alaayye qexerri hiyyaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">Hashshati hobonbaltetinna isoo ibisseeba gonphaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Boroti darrexxi diidallo mine isikenaa'ni isoo dukke adhdhite me'itaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Baqate fulo'a hiyyoolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">diidallo hunnati isi dare'n gandaan.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Diidallotinna iso'n caldeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">hexxeemaba hexee iso'n fiissiteen.»<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />«Ee birretika sibljo qonte fulichchinaxxi bakkanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">worqe qulleessinaaxxe bakka hexxe.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Sibiljo buttina qonte anfaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">medabi hinanaki sibiljinna kinjo bassinee'na afemaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Manji dukkana giddo ifa xasseexxi buttini giddi'a sa'e e'yiyyoti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">butti'a bayyate e'yiyyoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">dimmi hiteexxe dukkanna giddo sa'iyyoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">dukkanna dimmi giddo konnee siblo hanisaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Manji hedhammaba'ni ba'yyantee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">lekka mijiinxi haxxee egendeebaaba gennaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ookkonna genne yo'oxxa bale qontaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">wodarote'n rarrana'n manjokenaa'n qofi fullee hunjaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Butta indaaxxa midha lachchiissaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">ise giddi kinni giirati baqqe'e windiriqqi hitaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Senpere hiyyemaaki fixxeeki kinji isexxe kinuwwa giddo afemaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">Worqetinna isenge buttin giddo afendaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Konne kinjuwwibaa me'aaka ora risi ege'nebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">joletixxi illenna uuddebaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Elobaak biniichuwwi ettennee bakka haadhe ege'nebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">Neeniqi midde ookko'ni sa'ee ege'nebaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Manji anga ifixxen jabaka kinjo qotee fulchaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">koobuwwatanna booso isexenaa'n fottossaan<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Rassa giddo sa'aaxxa xuullo giissedhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">fixxeeka kinjuwwanna alfaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Galaaniinxa muummuwwa kofan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">butinni giddo sho'ondeemmaxxa karranna afaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />«Iite barota beekkumi habaa'n afema?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Ege'naa hexxaabita habate?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Beekkumi butta tenne'ni afemabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">hira isikanna dhugaati konneten hiyyee ege'naaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Beekkumi Abbaayyatixxe dhi'mo'ni afemabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">abbaayyati giddonna hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Beekkuma ca'itte worqenn hirrabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">hiri isikinna birretike sibiljinninna mikemabaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Beekkumi Ofiiri bogixxe worqennaa'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">Mereegidi, Senper hiyyemaake fixeeke kinjuwwi caala fiixeeken.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Worqetinna yo'oshsha ca'itte daa'wite isinni qixxoottabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">ca'itte worqenni giissemeek seessuwwinn jijjiiremabaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Zaagolinna Almaaze hinaaki fiixeeki kinjuwwiri isinni welt herregemmabaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">Beekkumiink hiri Luule hinaake kinjuwwi iimi darrenni<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Tophphaaz hinaaki Tophiyinke fiixxeeki kinjinna isenn qixxo'abaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">hara yo'oshsha ca'a hiteexxe worqenninna hiremabaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />«Yoonata beekumi habaa'ni dagaachcho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Ege'nata haba afenda?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Lubbo afeechchi duuchchixxe ille'n sho'ondeexxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">iima me'itaaxxi ci'uwwa midde hasse'e affebaan<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Ba'netinna reyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‹odo isexxa calla lanqenne› hinaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Beekkumiinbaa me'inaa oranna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">haba hedhaaxxa eg'naak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">Mageno callani.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Isi buttatixxe gabala duuchcha afaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">iimati butti'a hedheechcho duuchcha uudaan.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Diidallotee hunna uwwee wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">Abbaayyatika wode'e mike wodda,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />Xeenakeenna banqotee seera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">danbala'akeena ora uggee wodda,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />Mageni beekkuma uude bire ulfeesse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">qorqore bire eloken hiyye mure.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Ookkone wodda manjo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‹beekkumake hiyyo dada duuchchika Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sodaatateni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">ege'natinna fuggoxxenaa'n bayyatateni› isoo hiyye.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:10">Far. 111:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:7">Isa. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:10">9:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobixxa Muuxamiinxa Moronsha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Iyyoobi higgeenna lebe haaso'ee qici<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />Ta'ixxa anixxa hedho mittengele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">edo Mageni anee heqqaamma woddixxishsha kadda'neele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">silaan hittata eeyyanna'a!<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Eettenne yanna dukkana giddo me'aanna wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">Mageni ifa ifika ani'a xassaa'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">ifa isik giddo me'aannani<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Jaalo anike kade'e Magen mine anka heqqanaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">xoo'mamummati galaanna woddinge kadunnadu!<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Duchchiinxa dande'aak Mageni ani birii'ni qoya gopheemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">oose anixxi duuchchiinxi ani bira hexxemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Lekka anixxa adoti anshedhanno qico'n heddo lalo elmedhaannan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">careti boga'n hedheeka Ejersuwwa anka midde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">miincaa wodda gurre gonphaaxxe zayite alfaannan<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Qachchiinxe hulaba me'a'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">songote'n ofo'laanna wodda,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />Kaa'umi anee uudaa wodda edii'ni ke'amman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">geedhetinna anee ulfeessatee ofoldeemmabaani qophphi hitee kexxa'nemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Haaso'ake'n hexxemmaxxi ardiinxi geedhenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">anee affaa wodda afo'o abixxite'e sammi hita'emman.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Hayyoole bogiinxinna ani hedhennexxe bakka'ni haasootta'nemmabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">afo'i loqoxee'naa hitaaxxi baxxaamman.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Haaso'aa'naa laqqeki duuchchi anee jajeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">huje anixxa uudeek duuchchi anee galateeffate<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Tinninna hiyyeeyyetixxa raare laqe'e gargaaranaxxeenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">hado affebaaxxa oosenna wodaannaxeeten.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Lumoxxe rakko giddo hedheemmaka gargaarenaxxee anee eebbise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">aro'i reyemmaxxa melaale gargaarenaxxee gamada'nee ililisa'nemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Ani qullumma seemmatishsha oddo'wwenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">dhugaatixxa murtenna ejiinsha hana lephphenne; ruufatishshanna umoke'n mirqedhenne.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Ani balla'ake illetemman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">naafakee lekkatemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Hiyyeeyyetee annakemman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">ege'nebo'noke manni'aanna baassa'ennekemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Hunnaameessiinxa hirre enqa'nee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">hunnati adhdheemmachcho angii'ni ibisaannan.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />«Aninna godobik, ‹Wogga anxi abbaayyatike maanchishsha bira saxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">mine anike'n elo qicin reyannon,<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Ani duuchchi wodda wode'e alfa'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">shafa haanjedhammake haqichchishshatemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Duuchchi wodda ulfeessinaa'naa hedhaannan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">hunna anixxinna barra barrande'n haaroxxe gabeemman.›<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />«Manni ani hiyyannoxxa caqasatee sammi hiyya'nemman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">gorsa ankanna ca'li hiyye'e laqa'nemman.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Haaso'i anik insa'nee goddisaammaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ani haaso'enneelchchi uduma lebe haaso'amaki manji hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Hujalli mayetika xeena heqqedhammashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">haaso'a anika laqatee afo'o haanni hinee heqqinaan.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Goora anka insa'ne'a farri assanno wodda gammande</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">mushuddi hiyyenne wodda albi insa'neeki ife.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Me'inaaka ora kula'n insa'nee galcha'ennan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ifika sannachcha akeekaammake moyanjishsha akeeka'ennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">yaandaa woddanna dayyeessaneshatemman.»<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />«Ta'a kinni ilenshati ani'a uduma hedheeri ane'n geebeen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">insa'neeki annuwwiir hore anika heeqqaammmake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">worshiinxa duuka me'abaashsha hoyyaanakemmaran.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Hunna afebaa manna kadeemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">ani'a mitte la'o uwwaakemmabaan.<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Rakkotenaa'inna solo'okenaa'n kexxeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">gammoojje qiilli giddi'a me'ina'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">hiddichchuwwa qoltina'n corqina'emman.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Gammoojjexxe majajjaaxxa haqqeka shafuwwa qoce'naamman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">lujji hiyyabaaka kitikittake hinaake haqichchika hidduwwa qoltina'n indaamman.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Moodhalshe raarra'ni shorrinammashsha manni insa'nee olla'akenna'n shorra'emman<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Marraaba gonphe'e wolo'o giddonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">bowwa'i giddo hexxeexxe baluwwa giddo he'naamman.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Gongomi giddo harretishsha haa'insa'emman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">raaquwwa anfeeki giddonna mitteba bukk hina'nee he'na'nemman.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Kutik gannaa'na bogakenaa'ni shorremmeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">summa afebaakenna woyi fulabaake mannamman.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />«Ta'a insa'ne anee sirbina'n osolla'ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">geenbaake manjo kadeennen.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Diqante'e anibiri'a shiqa ginbeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">tuffante hancufa ane'n cirqanteen<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Mageni anee hunna hoyyeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">bixaalleemake fadhachchisha eeneexxa assineen.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Ani edi darre'n fuggoxxa assaaki ke'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">anee abindo'a fonxoro fannen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">anee miino'a hanseen.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Sa'anno ora kunte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">iitta assino'a insa'nee hoyyaaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isoo ayyinna gargaara dande'aak hedhebaan</char></note> hedhebaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">anee shinno'a ke'ne.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Lola'i dare e'yammashsha golla anika enqine e'yine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">duuchchin geechcho daake bira'n ane'n dage.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Alaalshite qexerri assitaaxxi yaanee ane'ni daggeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ulfin anik duuchchi diidallo adhdhite saxxaammalchiisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">fayyunte anixxinna hurretishsha saxxeen.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />«Ta'a hedho anixxi yo'oshsha wixxirri hiteen; reyotinna bayya hexxebaan.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Hashsha duuchcha micci duuchchi anee ita'n galaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">dhibe anenaa'ni mitte woyyoottebaan.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Mageni ela gonphe aneni bira sa'isseen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">lumoxxe ifixe hunnan huute abiddaammaxxe seemmashsha anee hudheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">odo'wennexxi seemma gunn gunni hite baxxeen.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Anee darbe buttinake'n ibiseemmmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">bukotenna bululoke kadeennen.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />«Ee, Mageno! Atee ye'edheennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">yaane kinni laqqeboxxon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">Uurrenna atee soodatenneni ati kinn ani'aa bucuqqi heteeboxxon.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Mararte belo ane'n kexxette</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">hunna affettexxe duuchchaninna anee gandetten.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Diidallot iimaa anee aaxxe ise'ni offo'lishshe, mammarensisse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">hobonbaltetinna elqenna kayya raassaashsha assitette<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Ati manji duuchchi'a qophpheesemeeke boonchibaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">reyotibaa? Anee geessissottaate kaddettexxa eg'neennen.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />«Ani ibeeke minishshaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ayyete anee dande'e qammalcha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">Ibe gatebo'nong Mageni anee ijaarabaata?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Rakkiyyette oodheennabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Hiyyeeyyetee yaadeennabaa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Eloxxi ani'a kaddaan hiyya'n hedaannan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">Elobaaxxi ane'n gelte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ifi ani'a xabaan hiyya'n heqqedhaanaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">barrandi ane'n dukkande.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Godobi anee cuulphiseen, ossa gopheen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">barra barra'inni rakko anee gandeen.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Arishshote kadebaang biso anika yaaddo xillisse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">ardiinxe oddo'n ke'ennexxi gargaarisa laqedhaannen.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Manjummatenaa'n fulee yayyeti, dayyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">bargudiinke jaalo kadeennen.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Bisi anik xilledhe raachcho'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">eebbinjjik gubatenne.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Gammadinni wodda geebannak gitaarinna suusu'le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">anixxi yaaddoti yuusanno wodda geebannoke miya kade.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />«Dubarte gaabbetixxe illeni uudabo'noshsha kakateenneni.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />«Iimii'n Mageniinbaa'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">manjokee muremeeki manjinki qoobbi maachcho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Iima hedheeke duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">manjokee uwwechchi maachcho?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Fuggaaleessa manjo'n ba'ne elobaaxxa hujaake'n fuggoxxi ege'nendaaxxebaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Assennexxa duuchcha Mageni uuda'nebaa? Takkaarro anixxa duuchcha dooyyaakebaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />«Dhara haaso'enneexxe kaddoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">lame afo'ike kadoonnole<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Mageni dhuugatixxe mike'n anee mikowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">balleessa belo hedhenexxanna ege'nowwaal<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Dhugaatike oranaa'n goreennexxe kaddoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ille anixxi uuddeexxa duuchcha goodobiki yorennexxe kaddoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">anga anixxinna cubboti xurootteexxe kaddoole<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />Ani facaalsenneka weli manji itowwaal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">midha anixxanna goggonshe birrowwaal<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Wele melaalle'a godobi anee jammi hiyyoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">anke ollalchixxa are aadhonnaa gaabboonole,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />Are anixxi mannakee garbake kadde'e daltowwaal weli labballi isenni welti galowwaal <verse eid="JOB 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />tinni fuggoxxi hujee seeri mura woxissaaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">lumoxxe balleessanni. <verse eid="JOB 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Tinni cubbo giiratishsha gube'e manjo balleesitaaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ani tenne cubbo silan hujeennele horatenelcho duuchcha silaa balleese biramman.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />«Meyya labbak aniki erganjuwwi ane'ni ku'leexxa yanne tuffate waaloonole,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />Mageni edo murtetee uurranno wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">maa kadoonaa hedhenne?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Anee qoraakee qortumi'a maa hiyye hiissonnaa hedhenne?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Anee ama anixxike gadaameessi giddo dadeeki erganjuwwa ankanna dadeengeba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Duuchchiinga no'o gadaameessi giddo dadeeki isondebaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />«Hiyyeeyye kadhateechcho hoyeedhe ege'nebo'no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">aro'o affebaaxxa melaalluwwa ooxxaana'a waale ege'nebo'no,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Anna affebaaxxi oose so'lo'witaa'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">qofi ite ege'nebo'no<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Yaane kinni oosummatenaa'n ta'i qico'n insa'ne'a anniinsha kadeenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">baro anke duuchcha'n aro'o affebaaxxa gargaarenneni.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Mitte manji daaree'naa yookaan mitti rakkichchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">oddo'waachcho gophe'e duwwi hedhee'naa afe'ee,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />anke gedhebixxe oordanni hujendeexxa seemma oddeese'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">eebbe'e ke'eexxi anee eebbisebaak hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Murtetixxe songo'n haaso'ennexxa duuchcha adhdhinaaxxa ege'nonnolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">anna affebaaxxa oose miidhonaa anga anxa insa'ne'n wirri asse ege'nebo'noni.<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />Tennee duuchcha assebo'noxxe kaddoole anga anixxi ceekotenaa'ni goshendowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">mikitake'ni enqende qurubbi hitowwaal.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Mageniinxa bala ani sodaataannen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">isike gaachchannannaa'ni kexxeexxinni mitteelchchonna assa dande'ebo'non.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />«Ille anxa karrate'n uggudhdhe eg'nebo'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">yookaan ca'itte woorqe'inna addate ege'nebo'non,<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Karra anxi bira saxxeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">duroommee heddo maallaqa alfeennen hiyye gammade ege'nebo'non,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Arishshotixxa bifa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">agenjiinka wa'ichcha ifa uude'e,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />Konneechchuwwa sho'iki Magenoonfaton'naa sobemebo'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">boba ga'na'n konnechuwwa ulfeesse ege'enebo'non<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Iitta assa iima hedheeke Mageni edo addatema gophatee kaddemmaxxee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">iitta assa Mageni reyotixxa murte muraashsha assitaaxxe cubbon.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />«Anee gibammaki manni rakkataa wodda gammadebo'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">yookaan fuuggoxxi yaane insa'ne'ni geltaa wodda ililisebo'non<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Naapha anka biro'a Mageno soodata'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">cubbo huje eg'nebo'non.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Anke bitumiki manni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‹Isike minenaa'ni itee goddebaaki hedhee?› Hiyye dhugaa haaso'aan.<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Ora me'aaka manna adhdhenne malee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">keessunsa gophe'naa'a gadho galeeki hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Balleessa anxa ifi giddo sho'edhebo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">wele mannishsha cubbo buqedhebo'non.<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Ardiinxi bira sa'ne anee alallishitee'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">mini hadixxi cee'manna anee sodaachissee'naa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">cuqqi hiyyebo'noki mine shoomennexxi yanna hexxebaan.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />«Silanni hiyyennexxa laqaaka afennele!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Hiissichcho anka konne kokeessannan; kunseten ank beessisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni ani'a hiissichcho uwwowwaal!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Anee ku'la'neeki ku'la'neexxa yaane silaan borreesse shiqishee'na'a afennele!<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Silaan dhugaa duuchchiing leellishsha duggumote'n dulke'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">kallachchiinsha albake'ninna uggudhdhannan.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Mitte hayyichchishsha Mageni edo shook belo qokki hiyye'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">assennexxa duuchcha mitte mitteti iso'n kulannan.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />«Fichchuwwiinka annuwwa miice'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">hunnati qadaada insa'neeka adhdhe'e hucconnole,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />Fichchuwwiinka annuwwa yaadise'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">mitteelchonna uwwebe'noki daffa insa'neeka iitoonnole<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />Iikki bogi dinnetixxe bakka'ni ute;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">soo'iinxe bakka'ni anso fulchowwaal.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Iyyoobi haaso'a uurrise.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Eelihuuka Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Iyyoobi ani qullichaken hiyyati yaadiki murum hiyyeemmaxxee; sasiing manni haaso'a uurrisse. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Raami hinaake minenaa'ni Buuzichchi Baarakelik belti Eelihu Iyyoobi Mageni irra umo ifi quloonseemmaxxee mufate. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Ittani sasiing Iyyoobik jaaluwwi Iyyoobi'n goddisaaka hiissichcho hiissa gonpheemmaxxeenna kunni insa'neeki hiissichchi Mageni balleessa hujeeshsha asseemmaxxee Eelihuumi insa'ne'n mufateemman. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Eelihuumi sasiinge mananaa'n ilenshati udu'maammaxxee duuchchiing haaso'e biree'na isinna Iyyoobinni welti haaso'o'a bado heqqedha'nemman. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Sasiing manni Iyyoobi'a hiissichcho geyaaka dandeenne'e uwwa gonpheexxa afeexxi aare bubbi hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Buuzichchi Baarakiki belti Eelihuumi hiyye hiissee qci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">«Ani ha'nonaa'n ilenshati udu'maannaxxeenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">ha'no kinni ani'a annuwwake kaddinaammaxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">shookeennaxxeenna sodaateennaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">yaado afenneka haaso'ebo'nongi konne qico tureennan.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />‹Lumolli edise haaso'uuni woggati galeeki beekkumiki barachchiisuni hiyyannoxxe'n hedhennan› hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Yane kinni manjoke'n hedhe'e beekkuma uwwaaki duuchchiinxa dande'aake Mageniinke haafuuran.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Manjo beekake assaachchi ciimotebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">dhugaatixxa yaane hubantaashsha gargaaraachchi qeerraxxa wogga turatebaan.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />«Tennexxe ani yaada afeenneka haaso'anna wodda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">ha'noonna qalbeti laqqe.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Haasoottinaammaka yaada caa'li hiyye laqa'ennan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">hitina'neexxi aaggaashsha malchitinee; haasoottina'eemmaka haaso'anna caqasa'ennan.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Co'o hiyye caqasa'ennani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">kaddomalee kinni ha'no giddii'ni mittikinna Iyyoobi akkisa dandeetinebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">haaso'aammake haaso'i'a rajji assaaka hiissichcho hiissatee dandeettineeki hexxinebaan.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Iyyoobi'a hasiisaaka hiissichcho uwwa dande'aaki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">‹Magenoke malee manjoke kada gopheemmaxxee ha'no beekkumake anfeenne hitina'ni ifi saaddinoqqe'e› hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Iyyoobi haaso'a'n moromaammaki ha'noonte malee aninitemmabaan ani kinni ha'nooke haaso'ike haaso'inni hiissichcho isi'a uwwabo'non.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />«Insa'nenna alanne haasonaachchi ba'emmaxxee mittelchcho haaso'a dandeennebaan.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Insa'ne hinaachcho gonphe'e sammi hinee uurrine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">insa'ne sammi hinooleta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">ani insa'nee heqqa'ni haaso'abo'no hiyyote?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Waawwo'o! Aninna anka hiissichcho uwwannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">afenneka yaadanna haaso'aannen.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Haaso'aannexxi heddo yaane hexxeemmaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ta'anni elqi'a yoona sammi hiyyaabo'non;<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Dhowa gelteexxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">woyinetixxe bookaxxe haaroxxe qalqalloshsha selli hiyye'ennen.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Haaso'e hafuura adhdho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">arrabikinna haasoo'iyyo hasissaan.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Tenne yaane'n ayyi'aanna gamisabo'non,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">ayyeenna kubbisabo'noni;<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Ani ayyeenna kubbise'e ege'nennelchchobaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">kubbisennele Mageni anee silaan iikkiwoddi shiyeemman.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />«Ta'anna koo Iyyoobi! Atee hiyyaannexxa laqi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">hiyyaannexxa duuchcha co'o hite'e caqas.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Haaso'onnaa shiqeennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">hiyyaannexxinna suume anxe'n hexxeen.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Anxe qajeelummashsha haaso'aannen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">arrabo ankenninna dhuugaate haaso'annon.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Anee dadeek Magenoken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">hedho ani'a uwweeki duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageniinke hafuuran.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />«Dandeettottole hiissichcho ani'a uwwi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">haasoottattolchcho qophpheeffatte'e uurite haaso'i.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Aninna ati Mageni eddo qixxenden;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">aninna dademeenneki butinakenaa'niten.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Anee sodaatiyyo hasissabaani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">ani atee miica dande'abo'no.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />«Haasoottettaxxa duuchcha caqasa'n tureennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">arrabo atikenaa'n fuldeexxa laqeennen.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Ati haasoottatto wodda ‹Ani balleessanna dedha afebe'no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">cubbo anee maqqebaake ca'ichchan.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Yaane kinni Magen anee ganatee mitte buuto anenaa'n hasseen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">naaphiinshanna anee uudeen.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Lekka anxa jirmiinxe oddo'n qarabe'e abideen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">me'aanneka ora duuchcha uuda'neen› hiteetten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:27">Iyo. 13:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Kunni haasoottetteki haaso'i dhuugaate kadebaaxxa ate'n kula'ennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">Mageni duuchchiinge Manji iimi darren.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Hittata Mageni manji kuleexxa laqabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">hita'n maaye Mageno aallattatto?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Manji qabataba'a male'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">Mageni gargar hedheeke orinni haaso'aan.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Hashsha manni ma'na sa'e cokokki hiyye dhiphaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">Mageni oojjotinna waleellati haaso'aan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Iyo. 4:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Ookkone wodda hiyyichcho isika lanqaashsha assaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">xexe'antaasha assatinna sodaachchisaan,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Konne qicinni manji cubbo huja waalashsha assan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">ifi sadinoteenaa'ninna gatisaan,<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Lubbo insa'neexxa ba'netenaa'ni gatisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">reyotenaa'ninna anjiraan.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Yookaan higgeenna manjiinke micci giddo ita'n duuchchi wodda hedhaake dhuukkubinni dhibemee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">ma'natike jaalo kadeexxi hedhaashsha assee xixaan,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />Konne qicinni dhuukkullichchi midha afo'iki abida gibisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">eloxxi ita duuchcha midde iso'o eyyissabaan,<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Huqqatatenaa'n kexxeexxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">maali mude'naa miqe calli gataan.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Reyo geyeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">lubbo isixxinna baletibaa shiqqaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />«Manjokee toggichcha ora leellishshaaxxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">kumuwwik laakko'endaaxxe Mageniinxe ergannanaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">mitte isibaa daggeexxi isoo gargaartaaxxe hexxeen.<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Erganjikinna isi'a marareexxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">‹Isoo lubbo wodaaka afeennaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">reyo'a waldoxxe'e hiyya'nee› reyo ajajaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Tennexxe maali isiki oosetike bisishsha hige wo'maan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">ka'iimummate'ninna haaroba higaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Ookkone wodda Mageno soodataan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">soodachcho isixxanna Mageni laqaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">isinna gamada'nee Mageno magenooffataan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Magenikinna isixxe qullummashshanni isi'a hira uwwaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Isinna manji edo urreexxi hiyyee farsaa qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‹Ani cubbo hujeneexxi dhuugaa dasseennen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">Mageni kinni balleessa anxishsha ane'n laakko'ebaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Lubbo anxa reyyotena'n gatiseen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">kunse ta'a hedhoti hedhee ifa udaannen› hiyye.<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />«Tennexxee Mageni iitta hexxeexxa yaane duuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">Manjokee higge higgeen assaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />Hedhotika ifa uudo'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">lubbo reyabaashsha assaan.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Haaso'annexxa co'o hite'e caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ani haaso'aannen ati sammi hiyyi.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Hita'ettelchchi hedhoole laqo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">ca'a hitottaa ati'a faaci'aannaxxee haaso'i.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Hita'ettexxi hedha gophphoole ani haaso'aannexxa ca'li hite'e laqi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">ani atee beekkuma barachchiisaanneni.»<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Eelihuumi lebeexxi haaso'a'ni hiyyee qici:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />«Ha'no beekkole haaso'aannexxa laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">ha'nonna qaroole hiyyaannexxa caqqasse.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Arrabik itatixxa xe'me egenammashshann</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">manshati haaso'a gargar hiissine egenaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:11">Iyo. 12:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Amme dhugaatixxa yaane fille egeno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">eldaaxxa yaanenna mitenba baranto.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />«Iyyoobi hiisseexxi, ‹ani qullichchaken Mageni kinni dhuugaatixxa murte ani'a mura gibe.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Ani dhugaatinge kadeenn hedhee dharichchiinsha uudemeenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">mitte balleessa afebe'no manji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">fayyitabaaxxe madanni rakkata'eennen.›<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Iyyoobishsha Magenoke'n roorreeki manji hedhee?<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Isiki jaaluwwi fuggoxxa hujaake mannan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">hositi insa'neekinna fuggoxxa assaake manninniten.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Isinna hiisseexxi, ‹Mageno gammachchiisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">manjokee mitte la'onna uutabaan› hiyyeen.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />«Ha'no qalbeeffatinaaki manni hiyyaannexxa caqasse! Fuggoxxa assa Duuchchi Woddike Goottanaa'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">daba huja duuchchiniinxa dande'aake Magenonaa'n bayyattowwaal!<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Mageni manjokee huje isixxishshann uwwaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">me'a isixxishshanni hira isi'a uwwaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Far. 62:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Duuchchiinxa danide'aaki Mageni haranga fuggoxxa yaane assabaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">ayye'ninna dhugaa dassabaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Butta Magenoke'ni maganne uwweedheeki hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">buttate'n hedheechcho duchcha'n moyaashsha harireekinna hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Mageni uffu hiyyeemmaka ifika hedhotika hafuura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">ifibaa hiissedhe aadho'a hedeele,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />Manjoke hiyyemeek duchchi mittenba mudeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">hige buttinake kadamman.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />«Qalbeeffattaattole tennee laqi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">haaso'aaneka haaso'anna caqasi.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Dhugaa eeyyabaaki moya dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Qullichchakanna lumoka Mageno ballesesanjoke assitatto?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Moyanjo ‹Ati woyi fuldabexxoken›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">ja'laabuwwakanna, ‹Ha'no fuggaaleeyyeten› ayyete hiyyaaki?<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Mageni duuchchiinga anga isixxen dadeemmaxxee isi ja'laababuwwakeenna gamisabaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">dureessa hiyyeessakenaa'n caalchiseexxi uudabaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Manni hashsha wodhakka dedhange'n reya dande'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ardikinna roqoonse ca'li hiyyaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">worba manna hiyyemaakinna manjiinxi anga kissebaang gophemaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />«Mageni manji me'eeka ora duuchcha afaaken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">mitte mittingixxa takkaarronna uudaaken.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Fuggaaleeyye Mageni edii'n itti shoo'onde gattaaxxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">dimmi dukkana haranga hexxebaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Manji isi edo murtetee shiqo'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">Mageni yanna isi'a woxaba'a.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Galchalluwwa insa'neke baalloomanaa'n ibiseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">bakka insa'neexxe'n wele uggo'a qorte maraba'a.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Tennexxee huje insa'neexxa eg'neemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">mitte hashsha'n mootummatena'n fugussee balleessaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Hujjeemmaxxe xaqaro'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">cubbaaleeyye manji edo mura woxisaan.<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Tenneenna insa'ne'ni assa'neechchi Isoo hordofa waaleemmaxxeetenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">seera isikanna balalli hineemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Hiyyeeyye miince Mageniinba raartaashsha assinee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">Magenkinna raare insa'neexxa laqe.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Yaane kinn Mageni sammi hiyyoole, ayyi isoo aallata dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Alba isika sho'edhoole, ayyi isoo uuda dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Isi manjokena'ninna, gosa gosake ardi iimi darren.<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Tinninna kaddeechchi jallichchi manji arda galchabaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">arda gibaaki moyanji fonxoro insa'ne'a fayabaashshaten.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />«Dedha mitti manji Mageno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‹Ani ta'i qico balleesseenne; langaxxa balleessabe'non.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Heenee cubbo hujennexxa ane'n leellishi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">balleessoonolenna langaxxa higabe'non hiyyee manji hedhee?›<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Eega ati aadde aaga gibbaattelchchinni ati shiqishshaatteke yaadishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">Mageni halcha atixxa muuxxaani hitee heqqitatto?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Tenne atende ifi'a mudhdhitattoxxe malee ani ati'a murabe'non</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">tennexxe ati egendettexxa haaso'i.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />«Hiyyaannexxa laqa'neeki beeki mani duuchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">qalbeeffata'neeki manninna ane'ni hiyya'nee qici,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‹Iyyoobi haaso'anee malee ege'nechchchi hedhebaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">haaso'i isiki giddo mitte gumma hexxebaan.›<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Fuggaaleessi manni hiissammake hiissichcho hiissemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">Iyyoobi geyaa qico'n hega uudemuummadu!<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />No'o edo seera sa'iyyoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">Mageno haaso'ik hurqiyyot tuffateen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">Iyyoobi cubbo huje'e jallotanna lephpheen.»<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Eelihuumi lebexxi hiyyee qici:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />«Koo, Iyyoobi! Ani Mageni edo qullichchake hitaatexxi seerakee?<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Mageno ‹Ani cubbo huja gophoonnole ati maa la'o alfitatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">Aninna maa lephphanno?› hitee qorteetten.<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />«Ta'a ani ati'aanna atinni welti hedheeke jaluwwa atikee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">hiissichcho uwwaannen.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Toggi hitee iimi'a uudi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">iimi darre hedheeki duumanchi atenaa'n hittee qicco bayyatte hedhexxa qalbefati.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Cubbo hujjoottole Mageno maayiki miitatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Balleessa lebbe bira sa'issite hujjootole isoo maa assitatto?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Qullichchake kaddottole Magenokee maa lebbatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">Isi atenaa'n alfaachchi hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Cubbo hujjoottole mittattoki atishsha hedheenge manjon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">eleoxxa hujjettexxi la'o uutaaki manjongeeten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:2-3">Iyo. 22:2-3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />«Mannik miiccami insa'neni birasa'oole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">miicammakixxe anganaa'ni wodaaka alfatee raarraan.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Yaane kinni, ‹Ane dademmaki Mageni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">manni lumoxxe rakko giddo faaro farsaashsha assaaki,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />Biniinchi caala no'o bararachchiisaaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ci'ati caalanna beekake kandannoshsha assaaki? Isi haba hedhe?› Hiyyaaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Insa'ne raarraan Mageni kinni hollaameeyyetenna fuggaaleeyyete kandeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">hiissichcho insa'ne'a uwwabaan.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Dhugaaten, Mageni dhariinxa soodachcho laqabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Duuchchiinxa dande'aaki Mageni wirri hiyyenna insa'nee uudabaan.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Mageno uudebe'no hitottolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">yaane atixxi isi eddo hexxemaxxee ossite heqqedhi,<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Iittanni Mageni mufate mura woxisabaake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">manji fuggoxxa assaa woddanna bashshi hiiyyeexxi waalaake ate'n labbee?<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Koo Iyyoobi! Woyi fulabaaka haaso'a tolanga bira sa'isitaaten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">hitaattexxanna egendebexxong ca'li hitee haasotaatten.»<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Ta'anna Eelihuumi lebe haaso'e hiyyee qici:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />«Mageniinxee haaso'aannexxi wele yaane hexxeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">ate'n ca'a asse haaso'onnaa shiixxoxxa yanna ossite laqi.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Magenokenaa'n alfenneke beekkuminni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">anee dadeeki Mageni dhugaatike kadeexxa kulaannen.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Haaso'i aniki dharake kadebaaxxa koki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">atinni welti haaso'aanneki ani woo'ma eg'na afennexxa ege'n.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />«Dhugaaten, Mageni hunnaameessaken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">ayyeenna tuffattabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">isi duuchchiinxe ege'neen.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Isi fuggaaleeyye lubbo galchabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">miicemeeke manni'a kinni dhugaati muraan.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Mageni qulliyye heqqaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">insa'nee moyanjuwwiinsha mootete'n ofo'lisheexxi duuchchi wodda insa'nee ulfeessaan<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Yaane kinni manni haachchabik uusuremoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">yookaan rakkotixxe fonxoronni abidemoole,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />Ifi saadat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">hunjeexxa cubbo Mageni inssa'ne leellishaan<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Xixichcho lanqaashsha mansha insa'neexxa banaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">fuggoxa huje waallee aadde aangaashsha insa'ne ajajaan<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Magenoke ajajeemma'n ergatemmoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">gataaka baro insa'neeka goddikinna gammadiki sa'issinaan<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Isixxa laqa ginboole wolaantichchik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yookaan ookkonee galaana fonfaan</char></note> mundaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">ege'na belonna rennaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />«Qalbe giddo Mageno addatabaaki duuchchi wodda aara'nee hedhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">Mageni insa'nee mura woxisaa wodda gattowaall alfino'a soodantabaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Labbaki labbaken yabaabuleemmaxxee qoommeemman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">ka'umummande'n rennaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Mageni rakkote'n hedheekaara rakkotenaa'n insa'nee anjiraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">gelteexxe rakko darre'n insa'nee ille manshanna banaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />«Ta'a tennee yanna'ninna Mageniinxi halcha atee rakkoti giddiini fulcheexxi elollaa ita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">qore wo'nshite ittattokee galdumi qico'n geltattoshshaten.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Ta'a kinni balleessanjiinxi murte ate'ni murendeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">geltaaxxa rakko adhate'n hexxetten.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Ayyinna atee karratixxe bira sa'nenni sobabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">mattikinna atee dedhisabaashsha heqqedhi.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Atixxe karraninna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">atixxe hunnake jabeenninni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">rakko giddii'n fula dandeettabexxon.<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Ardi ibeeba gophemaaxxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">dukkanatixxi barra daggaashsha halchitoxxe'e.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Higgetexxi fuggoxxa hujjabexxoshsha heqqedhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">rakkoti hega uudendaa'eettengechchi tennexxeeten.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />«Mageni hittee qico hunnaameessake kadeexxa qaabbati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">isi duuchchiinga sa'aake barachchiissallon.<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Mageno iitta assi hiyye ajajaaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">yookaan, ‹fuggoxxe hujeetten› hiyye aallataak ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Manni faaroti saadeemmaxxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">isixxa huje atinna saada deettoxxe'e.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Manji duuchchi Mageniinxa huje uude'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">mannikinna bayya hedhee isee afe'een.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Kunse Mageni no'ooxxe sammo iimi darre lumoken!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">Isike barika laakkossanna ege'naa dandeessissabaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />«Isi wodi'iinka shamina buttii'ni iimi'a aadhaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">xeenakenna asseexxi gansiisaan;<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Duumanchii giddii'n wodi'i butti'a lola'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">baradikinna manjiinxe saanne duuchcha'ni ganaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Kaddo malee Mageni duumancha hitta diriirseexxanna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">ifike minenaa'n dindinsoti hitta dindima'neexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">ege'na dande'aak ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Mageni eettenee dhi'mo abbaayya buqeexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">iseke qarqara'n ifixxa banqo hitta facaasa'neexxa uudi.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Konne qicinn Mageni arda ifika galcha'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">itaachchonna geyaa qico'n isi'a qophpheessaan,<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Banqotanna ifixxe anganni abidaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">mureeba'anna ibbaashsha ajajaan.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Dindinso jabaki xeen gana'neexxa kuldaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">horikinna midde hobonbalte dagga'neexxa ege'naan.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />«Hobonbaltetixxe birasa'nee'ni kexxeexxa godobi anee culphise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">alayyee raafemmenneni.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Haaso'a wodda haaso'a isika laqqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">dindinsotishsha dindima'neeka iska hiyyichcho caqanseen.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Banqo isixxa imi'n butti'a duuchchi booncho'n facaasaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">buttatixxe gabala qico'ninna geessisaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Ookkoneechchi udumi'a Mageniinke haaso'ixxi gungunso laqende</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">sodaachchisa'neek Isiki haaso'i balaqiinsha balaqa'nemman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">banqotiki xalaqqisinna ta'a ta'anni xalaqisaa'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">isike haaso'ika gaachchanninna gungunso laqisa'emman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">isike haaso'ika hafuura lanqaa wodda banqo hoyya'nemabaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Magen haaso'a wodda hafuuri isikixxi mambe'iinxi dindinso laqende</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">no'o egennabo'noxxa lumolla yaanuwwa assaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Kaade, buttate'n ibbaashsha assaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">jaba xeeninna ganashsha ajajaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Isi dadeemmaki manni huje isixxa ege'no'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">duuchchiingi manni huje urrisahaha assaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Ookkone wodda biiniichchuwwi baqatee sho'omamaba'a e'yaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">galaammabanna me'anni.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Jabaxxa diidaallo bita'in ke'isan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">qorri callixxa diidallonna middi'ni iyyedagaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Hafuuri Mageniinki wode'e qiidisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">jijjiirenna kaadete assaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Duumanchake'n wode'e ba'ise'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">giiddii'n banqotanna dhuqaashshan.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Duumanchuwwi Mageniinxe akeetteshshan qarqara buttatike duchcha'n doyaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ajajeemmaka ajajanna muuxxaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Mageni xeena gansiisaachchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">buttinna lashshi assatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">manna xixichchokee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">yookaan no'o eya'neexxa lellishatetee.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />«Koo, Iyyoobi! Haso'aannexxa co'o hite laqi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">Mageniinxa mambe'a hujuwwanna hubatte uudi.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Mageni duumanchuwwa hitta me'aashsha assa'neexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">banqotanna hitta dhuqaashsha'neexxa egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Duumancha iima helelliseekanna duuchchiinxa ege'neeke Mageniinxa mambe'a huje egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Holatta'neexxi gammoojexxi diidallo gandoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">ati eebbinjik baqqatton.<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Mageni iima baqqammaxxe daa'witeshsha dhisoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">ati Isi bira hexxe gargaartatto?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />«Yaadi no'oki dukkaneemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">no'oxxa yaane shiqisha dande'a gonphaannaxxee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">Magenoke'n maa hinannoxxa no'o'n kuli.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Magenoke'n haaso'aannen hiyye ke'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">maayeeta anee baleesso'a angandinni ye'edhaannek?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Diidallo hurre iimatenaa'n filte ca'a assitaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ayyinna arishsho ba'qqi hiyye'e uuda dande'abaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Middi darre'n worqete fakkaataak iffi leellaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Magenikinna sodaachchisaake gaachchanninni dagaan.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Duuchchiinxa dande'aaka Mageno afa dandeenabo'non,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">hunna isixxinna lumoxxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">isinna dhuugaati muraaken.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Hedumiki ifi beekkolette assaaka manna tuffataammaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">manjji duuchchi isoo sodaataan.»<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">Mageniinka Hiissichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageni hobonbalte giddo hedheexxi Iyyoobi'n hiyye haaso'ee qici;<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />«Beekkumi belo haaso'iyyoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">yaada anka diqqeessa'neeki kunni ayyete is?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Yoona labballoke kaddottole hidha duudhedhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">atee qora'ennen, hiissi.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />«Ati butta dadanno wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">ati haba hexxetta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Egendo'ottolenna qaabbatta'oottole amo mee ane'n kuli.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Butta ‹konne qico› lummexxaan hiyye'e mureeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Miko'a ise iima wodaro ise hanna ibiseek ayyete kadeexxa egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Buttatika utuphuwwa jabeessite'e abiddeexxi hunna maachcho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Ise ofoldeeka kinjo huje ugeeki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Soodimariinxi urjuwwa mitteba farsitaa'naa'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">iimixxi ergana duuchchanna ililissaamma wodda ati haba hexxetta'a?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />«Wodi'i buttiinke godobi giddii'ni pha'aa hiyyee wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">muummetixxa hula cufeek ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Abbaayya duumanchiki goleenneki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">dimma dukkananninna buqeennek Anten.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Abbaayya saxxabaashsha gabala giisse'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">hula isexxe'n danqarsanjo giisse'e uggennek Anten.<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />Konne qico'n daggatton!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">Ookko'n saxxaboxxon!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">Jabak atiki danbala'inna kabanni gabalemowwaal! Hiyyennek Anten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:22">Erm. 5:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Ilendettexxenni telchchi qico'n hara bogi soodaashsha ajajjee egndette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">Boro haachchabbaashshanna kuldeette?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Soodimari boro dayaa'seenaa ifini dago'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">fuggaaleeyye sho'ondeebaa'n farri asse'e leellisho'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">ajajje egendette?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Soodimariink ifin koobuwwatanna dhooquwwa gargar hexxeexxe bifaxxa seemma ode'wechcho fakkaatte leellitaashsha assaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">faariinke mi'yi hana leellitammaxxe qaphphantoshsha xuddi asse'e leellishaan.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Fuggaaleeyyetik ifininna gophemeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">fuggoxxa assinaammaxxi anguwwanna enqendeen.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />«Abbaayyatixxe dhi'mo giddi'a e'yitette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">Lumoxxe abbaayyaxxee muummebaa marte egendette?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Reyotixxa hula ayyete leellishe ege'neeki manji hedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Dimma dukkanaka cufananaa affe egendette?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Butta hittee qicixxe kaddeexxa egendeette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Egendoottole amo ane'n kuli.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />«Ifiniiba geessisaaka oranna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">dukkana haba hexxaaxxa egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Ifakkanna duukkanna bakka bakka ifixxe'ni dandeette hissitatto? Ifiinkkenna dukkanatike mine'n iyyemaraaka ora egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Butta dadendee wodda ilendeettaxxee egendettexxi kokaken!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Wogga atixxinna qeerraxxen!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />«Kaade ugginaake mine'n e'yteette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">Yookin tuulendeexxa kaade affeette?<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />Tinni kaade ani lolakeenna adhetee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">rakkot bari'a uggudhdhennexxen.<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Ifi habaa'n ke'e faca'a'neexxa egendeette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">Yookaan boroti darree'n daggaaxxi didaallo habaa'n kexxe butta duuchcha'ni gandaaxxa egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Xeenakee dagaaka ora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">balaqqaaxxe banqo'anna ora giisseki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Ayyinna hedhebaake boga'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">manji ofo'labaaxxe qiilla gammoojje'n,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Xeeni ganaasha assaaki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">Mittilchchi latabaaka bagoka boga shanshe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">badda'a lattaashsha asseeke ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Xeeni anna afee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Yookaan fixeesa ileeki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Kaade ayyike gadaameesanaa'n fulde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Iimii'n dagaaka qorra ayyete ile?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Qorri wode'e kinjiinsha assaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">dhi'mo abbaayyaka wode'enna kaadetishsha jabataashsha assaan.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />«Piliyaadis hinaaxxa urjuwwa mitteba usura dandeetatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Yookaani Ooriyo hinaaxxa urjuwwa mitteba usurteexxa wodaro tansha dandeettatto?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">Iyo. 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo. 5:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Uurjuwwa duuchchi ififixxe yanna'n fuldaashsha assa dandeettatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">Dibi hinaake biniichixxa dhagga affeexxa lumolluwwa shiixxaramma urjuwwa ajaja dandeettatto?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Iimixxe dadaka galduumiinka seera egendeette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Kunni seeri buttate'n hujaashsha assa dandeettatto?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />«Xeena ati'a lolasaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">duumancha ajaja dandeettatto?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Banqo atike ajajinni balaqqaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Qalbetee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni kunni hiyyichchi adda ege'nemaba'a</char></note> beekkuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">sammoteenna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotike laagadinni kunni hiyyichchi adda ege'nemaba'a</char></note> qalbeeffachcho uwweek ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Buko jabataa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">gugu'motinna mitteba dhabendaa wodda,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Duumancha laakko'atika beekkuma afeeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">iimatike waabanaa'n wode'e butti'a duna dande'aak ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Badda'a giddo Neenquwwi ciise'e gadaa'naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">meyyake Neenqi'a adamo adandatto?<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />Isexxa solo'witeexxa beltanna itisse dandeettatto?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Beltanna qoodhandiinxi ittaachcho gophphe'e haafendaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">anibaanna raartaa wodda ittaachcho uwwaaki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />«Buddanne ildaaxxa yanna egendeette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Gadansi ciniinfate ilaa wodda affe'e egndette?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Godoba afe'e hitteexxa yanna turaaxxanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">haano illaaxxa egendette?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Guluffate ciniinfate beltanna ildaaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">haanote kaddeexxa egendeette?<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Beltanna insa'nexxi badda'a giddo nophphite jabaattaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">fulde me'iteechchi kayyi'a langaxxa amatiba'a hingabaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />«Diidi giddixxa harre fedhe galdaashsha wocci asseeki ayyete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Usurrakenaa'n isee tikeeki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Qiilla gammoojje mine iseke'n galdaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">maxine callike boga'ni'nna hexxaashsha asseennen.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Isenna canci bira sa'eeke qachchuwwana'n bayyatte'e hexxaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">edi'a oofa'n cancaaka manna egendebaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Koobuwwate'n bobbaate hossaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">ookko itate kaddaaxxa haanjaxxa badda'a halsitaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Gafarsi ati'a ishshi hiyye hujaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">dala'i atiki giddo galaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Gafarsa qotiyyotishsha usurte'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">ati'a hujaashsha assa dandeettatto?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Jabaxxa hunna afeemmaxxe'e isoo addattatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Jabaxxa atixxa huje iso'n waaldattota?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Atibaa ileema hige'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">ati'a midha aldu'metiba'a guraan hite'e heqqexxatto?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />«Balguddi keela ifika rakee diriisedhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">yaane kinni qongishsha me'aba.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Balguddi quuphphe bukoti hana ibisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">butinange'n hedhe'e eebbo'a waalaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />‹Ookkoo'n mittilchchi sa'a wodda lekkati hadhe enqaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">yookaan biniinchi mitti hadhe butuchchaan› hite'e hedabaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Beltanna isexxe kaddeebaashsha godoba jabataan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">elo isexxi tola gattoolenna yaadabaan,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Iitta beekkuma afabaashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">hoyyedhennekinna gowwitaashsha assennek Anten.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Gongichchoke kexxaa wodda kinn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">fadhadokanna gulufeemmaka manna osoldaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Fadhadoke'e hunna utetteki goobake'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">shuuroota oddeesite seessetteki atetee?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Koro'miisiinsha xogge koqa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">manjo alanshaashsha ati assitato?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Fadhado bagediinbaa adhetee gulunfe me'inoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">hunna ifixxe'n addate garmaama'nee himimmisaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Ijje soda'atte hinaachcho afeban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">mittelchchonna riffi hiyyaba'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">bagedo donbee'naanna midde udumi'a higabaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Gulufeeki loliinkki manni abixxeek loliink miyuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">calaqisa'n welti ganema'n qililisaa'na laqaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Onno'ee buttina giwwisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">malagata ufuunfee'naa laqoole loliinbaa qolcho'a hooxemaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Malagata ufuunfee'naa laqoole ‹hashshu› hiyyaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">bayyii'ninni adhetika foole aadhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">bagedo ajajammake mannika hafuuranna ardiinka canca laqaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Jole dota'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">keela bita'i dare'n bande'e me'ita'neek atike beekuminnitee?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Sinbiri iimi'aa bayyate me'ashsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">yookaan alaatte mine ijaadhdhitaashsha barsiissatto?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Allaate lumolla kinoxxe oddo'n hexxaan; ookkonna mine ijaadhdhitaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">lumolla kinonna ise'a gollake kaddaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Ookko hexxee ittaachcho gaaddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">ille isexxinna bayya hedheechcho affaan.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Konne qicin Alaattuwwa renshin qarqara'n bukki hitaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">beltanna isexxinna munde ha'witaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mat. 24:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luq. 17:37</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Lebeexxi Mageni Iyyoobi'n hiyye haaso'e qici <verse eid="JOB 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />«Koo Iyyoobi! Isi manji duuchchiniinxa dande'anoke Mageniin, anini welti morome'e injifataachcho ate'n labbee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Ane'e Mageno moronda'eteki atete kaddettexxe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">amo ani'a hisichcho hissi.»<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Iyyoobinna Magenoke'n hiyye haso'ee qici<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />«Gotta! Ani mittilchchi'anna woyi fulabo'noke manijjon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">ta'a yoona afo'o anka buqedhe sammi hiyyannolocho malee maa hiyyeta ati'aa hiissichcho hiissanno?<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Ani mitele woldo haaso'eennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">ta'an elqi'a langaxxa hara haaso'abo'non.»<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Ookkoneechchi uuduma Mageni diidalloti gidd'n Iyyoobi'n haaso'e hiyyee qici;<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />«Kexxettexxi labballoke kaddoottole hidha duudhedhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">atee qora'ennen; atinna hiissichcho ani'a hiissi.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />«Ani murte dasseenneshsha assitee uuddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">ifi qulloonisitatto?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Eeger Ati hunna giddo anee Mageniinshsha jabake?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">Qonqo atixxi Anee Mageniinxe qonqoshsha banqotishsha dindinda'nee?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Iittate kaddoole gaachchanna hunna afeettekenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ulfaattee saadendendeettekentaa!<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Hollaantiyye uuddee mufatta'n salphisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">mufe atixxeni insa'nee gani.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Ee hollaantiyye duuchcha uuda'n saliphis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">fuggaaleeyyatanna hexxe hexxeenba bir.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Rensha insa'neeka seemmat mirqite'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">duuchchiinga mitteba buttni hunda moogi.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hunna atixxe'n ifi anjirttattoxxa aninna bado anxe'n atee faarsannon.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />«Ani atee dadeneshan Roophetanna dadeennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">Roophetinna qotiyotishsha baddaa dheeddaan.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Hidha iseke'n hedheeka jabeennanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">biso iseki giddo hexxeexxe ribotixxa hunna uudi!<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Eege isexxi birbirsiinke haqichchishsha toggi hitteexxen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">tafi iseki hiddi furdakenna jabaken.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Miqqe isexxi sageetto gissinammake sibljishshateni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">sibljinxe zangeshsha jabaxxen.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Ani dadeennexxe dada duuchchanaa'ni hunnaameettete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">anee malee isee injfataaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Biniichi bobba'axxe kooba'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">ittaaxxi baddaa ise'a lattan.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Gaaddisa afeeke haqichchi hundanna qooceti giddo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">caffa'a hexxeeba diiphphaani.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Gaaddisa affeexxi haqqe isee gaaddissaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">qooccetinna isee buqqani.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Wodi'i dage woo'moolenna sodaattabaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">Yordaanoosiki galaani afo'in qico'ni geyoole riffi hitabaan.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Ille balleesiyyotinna malxaqqoti sano urre'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">Roophe dande'e abidaaki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />«Leewaataani hiyyemaaka Abbayya giddika biniinchcha malxaaqqoti abbaayya giddii'ni dandeette abidatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">Yookaani afo'o isika wodaroti dandeette bixaaldatto?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:14">Far. 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Isa. 27:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Sano isixxe'nni malxaqqo e'yishshe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">qeqqeshsha isike'ni malxaqqo uggite'e dandeette abiddatto?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Isi'a marartattoshsha atee kadhataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Atee sobata'nee?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Ati'a garbumma hujo'aa duuchchi wodda hedho'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ati'a ishshi hiyye ajajemaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Isoo ci'atishsha abidde'e usurtatto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">Yookaani duubarri atik daa'wataashsha usurte waaldatto?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Qulxu'metixxi daddalto isoo hidhdhito'a gadhaffa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">wowoxxe'e qoodenda?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Eetetteba goga isika bagedik urte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">umo isika wolaanitichchiki woxxa'ni kochchissatto?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Dandeettottole angati isoo kiisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">isinni welti abixxitatoxxi wo'lanichcho hara deetaboxxoxxe kaddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">higge langaxxa isinni wo'laancho abixxitaboxxon<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Leewaataani hiyyemaake biinchinni welti wo'laancho abixxe'e injifatanno hiyya dharaken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">iso uudeeki duuchchi alaayye'e gilgilaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Eeganni iso shiyiyyo konne qico a'urtoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">anee moroma dande'aakita ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Iimati butti'a hedheechchi duuchchi anilchchoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">hiissannoshsha ani'a liqeesseek ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />«Laawaataanixxe lekkaxxara; hunna isixxike jabeennixxara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">elle biraaki isike bisixxara haaso'ebo'nok waalabo'non.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Isika dibba goganna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">kallaada isika dande'e dulaaki ayyete?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Tennee yo'oshsha sodaachchissaaxxi isixxi isso hexxeeka afoo'o maaqe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">ayyete qeqqeshsha isika maaqaaki?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Isike dudduriki gogi googeessiki cayyendeexxe wontuwwashshaten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">yo'oshsha weli iima dhabbite'eemmaxxee sibiljiinsha jabaattaan<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Mitti mitteke'ni jaba qicinni dhabbemeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">diidallo midde oddotenaa'ni saxaa qici hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Duuchchiing mitti mittiki welti dhaabbemeeke kaddeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">mittilchinna welinaa'ni dande'e garar hiissa dande'amabaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Isi heexifataa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">ifi xalaqisa'n leellaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">ille isixxinna gorsixxe arishshoshsha iffaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Afo'o iskenaa'ni giiratiki bubeni fulaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">giiratixxi qaanqenna facaataan.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Meshe dhaanbeexxe boosonaa'n fuldammaxxe wiliilleshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">sano isixxee'ni wiliille tuqu tuqu hitaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Afo'o isikeenaa'ni fulaaki eebbinji giira ha'ishshaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">giiratiki bubenjinna afo'o isikenaa'ni fulaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Goobi isikixxi lumma hunna affeenni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">albi isikiki gaachchanni yo'oshsha sodaachchisaaken.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Maali isiki weli iima dhaabeemeeke kadeemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">bisi isiki sibljinshhsa jabaatanai.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Godobi isik kinjinsha jabakeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">jabeenni isikinna daamiinke kinjiishshaten<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Kunni biniinchi ke'aaxxa yanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">hunnaameeyye midde alalte gilggiildaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Fedheeki bagedi wolaantichchikinna marciki ontoole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">isoo maadoossabaani.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Bagedi iso'ni goroole micciinsha bututaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">sageetto giisinaaki sibiljinna quqi iteeke haqichchishsha bullo'aan.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Gabe iso'ni darbinoole sodaate baajabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">looyyatiki kinji isi'a hicaaciinshaten.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Mogidi isi'a badda'atishshateni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">bagedo iso'ni darbinoole oso'lee qere qere hiyyaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Dhoqqe giddo godobiki me'aa wodda isiki qari callik gogi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">buttina qotiyotike sibiljishsha dadaaraan.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Abbaayya ebbee wodi'isha daanfisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">meshete'n ganfeexxe Zayiteshsha finissaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Isi sa'eeki ori ifaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">Abbaayyati wodi'inna honbe luggaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Dada duuchchanaa'ni iso'ni sodaachchisaachchi mitti hedha gopheemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">buttate'ni isoo geyaaki biniinchi hara hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Isi yo'oshsha lumolla dada duuchcha midde tuffataani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">isi biniinchi duuchchike moyanjon.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyoobii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyoobi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hiyye hiissee qici; <verse eid="JOB 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />«Ati assitottaa heddettexxa duuchcha assitattoxxa ege'neennen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ayyinna atee hoyaaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Ani ege'nennexxi shixxoxxe calla kaddee'naanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">‹maayyee ege'nebo'noxxa heddo yaane haaso'ennexxa anee qorteetten›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">dhuugaandeni, ege'nebonoxxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">heddo mambe'a yaanuwwaxxara haaso'eennen.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />«Atinna anee, ‹caqasse'e ta'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">anike qortumi'a hiissichcho hiissi› hiteetten.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Ani ta'i qico'n atixxa yaane ege'neenneki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">manji hiyyeexxe calla laqatitemman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:5">Ta'a kinni ille anixxi atee uuddeen.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Tinni haaso'ennexxi duuchcha anee shookishsheemmaxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">bukote'ninna bululoke'n ofo'le'e aadde aaga'ennen.»<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qunqumatika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyoobinni haaso'a bireechchinni udumi'a Teemaanike bogika manjichcho Elifaazii'i hiyyee qici, «Ha'no garbichcha aneke Iyyoobishsha anxe yaanexxara dhuugaa haaso'a gophphineemmaxxee ate'ninna lamiinge atike jaaluwwa'ni mufateennen. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Tennexxee ta'a ke'xxineexxi torbaane jibootanna torbaane gedhebiinxa korbeeyye adhdhitine'e Iyyoobibaa marre; ookko ha'no ifi ifinxe cubbo'a ciincatika tolcha tolche. Anki erganji Iyyoobi ha'nooxxee anee soodataani; aninna soodachcho isixxa laqennexxi cubbo ha'nooxxixxe qixxe'n ha'noo mufeti ganaannaxxa waalannon; ha'no Iyyoobishsha anxe yaanexxara dhuugaa haasoottinebaan.» <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Teemaanike bogik manji Elifaazi, Shuhake bogi mnji Bilidaadinna Na'imaataawwichchi Tsoofaari marreexxi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ajajemmashshanni assine. Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna Iyyoobixxa soodachcho laqe.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Iyyoobi sasiinge jaaluwwa ifikee soodateechchinni udumi'a Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti haaroba iso duuronse; edo afeemmake qaabeennanaa'ni caala lame anga asse uwwe. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Ookkone wodda Iyyoobiki dayyuwwi dayyuwwanna edo isoo ege'neemmki duuchchi isoo uudo'a dage; mine isike'ni ofolle; welti inde; Mageni iso'ni iyyedageemmaxxe jabaxxe rakko'a welti yaandeexxi dayyeessine; mitti mitting birretike sibilixxanna worqetixxa qube iyyedange'e isi'a uune.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyoobi edi woddi caala eebbise. Tennexxe Iyyoobi tommenna shoole kuma gedhebo, jaane kuma Gaala, mitte kuma qaanja qootiyo, mitte kuma meyyaxxa harre afeemman. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Haaroba torbane laballonna sase duubara i'le. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Dubarri ifiki giddii'ni taakkaxxika summa Yimiima; langaxxika Qetsi'o, sakkaxxika Qerenhafuuki hiyye fulche. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Buttate'ni Iyyoobika dubarra danchummati lekka insa'neexxa uggitaaxi duubarte hexxemmabaan. Iyyoobinna labbaxxe ifixxe oose'a uwweeshshanni dubarrakeenna geyaaka geego qoode.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyoobi 140 woggaa ture'e; oosetixxa oosuwwanna sholgaxxe ila qico'ni uudaa qico'n geye. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Wogga godde'e cime'e reye.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>